Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.76,0:01:19.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Lúc nào tôi cũng tìm kiếm nó.{I'm always searching for it}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.54,0:01:31.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Luôn theo đuổi nó.{Always seeking it out}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.74,0:01:42.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Thất bại,{A miss. Kelp filling again.}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.88,0:01:44.14,Default,,0,0,0,,{\b0}lại rong biển à?{A miss. Kelp filling again.}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.68,0:01:46.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Đều là rong biển hết đấy.{Today's is all kelp.}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.84,0:01:47.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Tại sao vậy, Akane?{Why, AKane?}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.12,0:01:50.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Đã bảo cậu làm mayonnaise với cá hồi rồi mà.{1 said a million times\N{hal 1 want mayonnaise and tuna!}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.04,0:01:51.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Em thích rong biển.{- I like kelp.\N- You heard her.}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.95,0:01:52.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Vậy đấy.{- I like kelp.\N- You heard her.}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.90,0:01:54.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Mi thua Aoi rồi.{You lost to Aoi.}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.82,0:01:56.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Nghìn lần như một.{A million times said, and you still lost.}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.88,0:01:59.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Im đê.{Shut up.}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.84,0:02:01.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Tập thôi.{Come on, let's practice.}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.88,0:02:04.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Ta vẫn đang ăn mà!{But I'm still eating!}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.91,0:02:06.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Vậy thì ăn lẹ đi!{Hurry up and finish!}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.28,0:02:08.71,Default,,0,0,0,1,Cây "Akane Special" này sắp sửa gầm lên đấy.{My "Akane Special” is going to roar.}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.83,0:02:10.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Tên dở tệ.{That's a terrible name.}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.54,0:02:12.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Aoi nữa.{Me too.}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.71,0:02:14.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Em cũng muốn chơi.{I want to play, too.}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.05,0:02:18.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Vậy anh dạy em chơi guitar nhé?{You want me to teach you the guitar?}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.55,0:02:23.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Vậy em muốn chơi món nào?{Then what do you want to play?}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.40,0:02:29.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Thật à?{What, seriously?}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.73,0:02:32.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Không lẽ Aoi hâm mộ anh à?{Do you admire me or something, Aoi?}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.00,0:02:33.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Không!{No!}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.33,0:02:35.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Thật luôn à?{Really?}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.19,0:02:39.28,Default,,0,0,0,1,Nhưng con gái mà chơi được bass chắc ngầu lắm nhỉ?{Come to think of it,\Nit'd be cool if a woman played the bass.}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.91,0:02:41.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Vậy Aoi này,{All right, Aoi! When you get bigger,\Nyou'll play bass in our band.}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.08,0:02:43.49,Default,,0,0,0,,khi lớn lên, hãy vào band bọn anh nhé.{All right, Aoi! When you get bigger,\Nyou'll play bass in our band.}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.58,0:02:45.37,Top dialog,,0,0,0,,Vậy còn ta thì sao?{Hey! Then what'll I do?}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.45,0:02:47.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Aoi thích nhé.{Good for you, Aoi.}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.40,0:02:48.83,Top dialog,,0,0,0,,Mi hợp xướng được không? {Abo, you can be the chorus?}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.96,0:02:52.04,Top dialog,,0,0,0,,Múa phụ họa thì sao?{Or how about a dancer?}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.13,0:02:53.63,Top dialog,,0,0,0,,Cái tên Banba này.{Listen, Banba.}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.77,0:02:55.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Thôi thôi, tập thôi nào!{Come on, we're going to practice, right?}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.96,0:02:57.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Tập bài gì trước đây?{What should we start with?}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.78,0:03:01.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Ý Akane sao?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.93,0:03:02.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Như mọi khi.{The usual!}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.18,0:03:04.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Được thôi.{All right!}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.22,0:03:05.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Lại nữa à?{Again?}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.37,0:03:06.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Bắt đầu đi, Michinko!{Here we go, Michinko!}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.20,0:03:07.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Biết rồi.{Yeah, yeah.}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.31,0:03:09.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Đợi chút.{Wait a second.}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.89,0:03:10.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Đợi chút đã!{Oh, come on!}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.48,0:03:13.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Banba, cắm mic vào!{- Banba, plug in the mic!\N- Huh?}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.06,0:03:15.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Bắt đầu thôi!{All right, here we go!}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.75,0:03:18.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Ở nơi đấy...{If you go there...}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.28,0:03:54.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Thế nhưng...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.45,0:03:57.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Nơi ấy...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.03,0:04:02.57,Default,,0,0,0,,thật xa vời.{is just so far away...}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.65,0:04:04.16,Default,,0,0,0,1,Bọn họ bị tai nạn...{They were in an accident...}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.24,0:04:06.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Cả hai đều qua đời ...{For both of them to go...}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.16,0:04:08.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Nghe bảo vì người kia không chú ý quan sát.{I heard the other person\Nwasn't watching the road.}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.87,0:04:11.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Thật đau lòng, bỏ lại hai đứa trẻ.{It's such a shame,\Nleaving two daughters behind.}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.29,0:04:14.79,Default,,0,0,0,1,Akane đang năm ba cao trung phải không?{Akane is a third-year student, isn't she?}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.29,0:04:16.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Biết làm sao bây giờ?{What will she do?}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.69,0:04:18.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Aoi này,{Aoi, be a good girl and obey your sister.}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.02,0:04:21.23,Default,,0,0,0,1,ở với chị phải ngoan và vâng lời chị nhé.{Aoi, be a good girl and obey your sister.}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.63,0:04:24.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Từ giờ trở đi, hai đứa sẽ phải cố gắng nhiều đấy!{From now on,\Nthe two of you will have to work hard.}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.69,0:04:40.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Tớ không thể đi được.{I can't go there.}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.49,0:04:43.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Tại sao?{Why? What do you mean?}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.41,0:04:45.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Tại sao vậy?{Why? What do you mean?}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.78,0:04:48.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Ta đã hứa sẽ cùng vào trường nghề ở Tokyo rồi mà!{We made a promise to both go\Nto a vocational school in Tokyo!}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.25,0:04:53.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Akane!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.50,0:04:57.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Không được bắt nạt chị Akane, đồ ngốc!{Don't bully Akane, you dummy!}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.00,0:04:59.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Aoi.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.34,0:05:01.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Không được mang chị Akane đi!{Don't take Akane away from me, you dummy!}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.12,0:05:01.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Đồ ngốc!{Don't take Akane away from me, you dummy!}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.05,0:05:02.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Đồ mập địch!{Fatso!}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.67,0:05:02.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Mập?{Fat? My body fat is 7%!}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.99,0:05:05.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Mỡ của anh chỉ có 7% thôi đấy!{Fat? My body fat is 7%!}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.69,0:05:06.76,Top dialog,,0,0,0,,Này, Aoi.{- Shut up, you pig!\N- Hey, Aoi.}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.47,0:05:06.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Anh im đi, đồ mập địch.{- Shut up, you pig!\N- Hey, Aoi.}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.84,0:05:07.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Khỉ đột!{Monkey! Gorilla! Don't take Akane away!}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.58,0:05:08.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Gorilla!{Monkey! Gorilla! Don't take Akane away!}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.36,0:05:09.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Không được mang chị Akane đi!{Monkey! Gorilla! Don't take Akane away!}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.90,0:05:13.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Chị Akane và Aoi sẽ mãi mãi ở cùng nhau!{Akane and 1 will always be together!}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.16,0:05:23.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Tôi vẫn... {I'm still looking for it.}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.44,0:05:25.86,Default,,0,0,0,,đang tìm kiếm nó. {I'm still looking for it.}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.46,0:06:25.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Theo đuổi nó.{I'm searching for it}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.31,0:06:34.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Nơi mà mọi giấc mơ...{The place where all dreams come true.}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.66,0:06:37.21,Default,,0,0,0,,đều trở thành hiện thực.{The place where all dreams come true.}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.85,0:06:50.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Em sẽ lên Tokyo ạ.{I'm going to Tokyo.}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.28,0:06:53.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Tôi hiểu đó là nơi em muốn đến,{I understand the place you want to go,\Nbut it's not for college, right?}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.42,0:06:55.62,Default,,0,0,0,,em không định vào đại học, đúng không?{I understand the place you want to go,\Nbut it's not for college, right?}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.87,0:06:56.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Nghề nghiệp là gì?{Employment?}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.47,0:07:00.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Em sẽ vừa đi làm vừa chơi trong một ban nhạc ạ.{I'll work part-time\Nwhile rising to fame in a band.}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.16,0:07:01.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Ban nhạc à?{A band... Who are the members?}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.63,0:07:02.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Ai là thành viên?{A band... Who are the members?}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.73,0:07:04.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Mình em thôi ạ.{Just me.}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.12,0:07:07.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Tôi sẽ đánh vào mục nghề nghiệp.{I'll check off "employment.”\NOkay, next. Ohtaki, come in.}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.21,0:07:08.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Kế tiếp, Ohtaki.{I'll check off "employment.”\NOkay, next. Ohtaki, come in.}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.97,0:07:09.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Vào đi.{I'll check off "employment.”\NOkay, next. Ohtaki, come in.}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.47,0:07:10.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Vâng.{Okay.}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.97,0:07:14.41,Default,,0,0,0,1,Đang có tâm trạng à?{Is she in a mood?}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.73,0:07:15.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Ohtaki,{- Hurry it up, Oht--\N- Oh, I'm going to become a bride!}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.64,0:07:16.19,Default,,0,0,0,,nhanh nào.{- Hurry it up, Oht--\N- Oh, I'm going to become a bride!}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.44,0:07:18.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Em sẽ trở thành cô dâu ạ.{- Hurry it up, Oht--\N- Oh, I'm going to become a bride!}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.70,0:07:20.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Hiện em chưa biết đó là ai nhưng...{- I don't know who the person is, but--\N- Okay, "Employment."}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.54,0:07:22.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Làm nghề luôn à?{- I don't know who the person is, but--\N- Okay, "Employment."}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.48,0:07:23.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Tiếp theo.{Okay, next.}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.57,0:07:26.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Ta bàn thêm tí nữa đi thầy.{Hey, let's talk a little bit more about my future!}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.73,0:07:36.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Vào cuối năm, công việc ở tòa thị chính sẽ khá bận rộn.{City Hall gets busy near the end of the year.}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.31,0:07:39.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Có lẽ tháng tới chị không đón em được.{I probably can't pick you up next month.}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.57,0:07:44.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Đi bộ từ nhà đến trường mất đến một tiếng lận đấy.{It takes about an hour\Nto walk to school from our house!}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.16,0:07:46.80,Default,,0,0,0,1,Giờ đang là mùa đẹp mà.{Well, it's a nice season.}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.88,0:07:49.84,Default,,0,0,0,1,Khi lên núi em sẽ thấy lá thu đẹp như thế nào.{You get to admire the autumn leaves\Nwhile hiking up the mountain.}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.80,0:07:53.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Em ghét đồi núi.{I hate mountains.}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.05,0:07:59.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Ở cái vùng trũng này, cảm giác cứ như bị bao quanh bởi các bức tường ấy.{When you're living in a basin,\Nit's like being surrounded by walls.}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.52,0:08:04.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Còn chúng ta thì đang bị giam cầm trong một nhà tù khổng lồ.{We're being held captive in a gigantic prison.}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.40,0:08:06.81,Default,,0,0,0,1,Đây rồi, câu hát trừu tượng của Aoi.{There it is! Your puberty lyrics.}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.82,0:08:08.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Chị nghĩ sao cũng được.{Okay, whatever.}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.57,0:08:11.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Dù sao đi nữa thì em vẫn sẽ đi khỏi nơi này.{Anyway, I'm going to leave this place.}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.84,0:08:31.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Xin chào!{Hello!}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.22,0:08:34.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Akane với Aoi.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.80,0:08:35.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Về rồi hả.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.89,0:08:37.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Có chuyện gì thế ạ?{What are you doing?}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.35,0:08:38.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Buổi họp mặt tối nay.{Tonight's meeting.}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.01,0:08:41.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Masamichi mời nhiều khách quá.{Masamichi invited too many people}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.52,0:08:44.31,Default,,0,0,0,,nên cô mượn ít nệm và bàn chỗ cô Yamaguchi.{so I was just borrowing some cushions\Nand tables from Mrs. Yamaguchi.}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.89,0:08:46.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Để cháu phụ một tay.{- This should be plenty now.\N- Yes, I think so.}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.95,0:08:46.97,Top dialog,,0,0,0,,Không cần đâu!{- This should be plenty now.\N- Yes, I think so.}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.69,0:08:48.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Đi nào Aoi.{- I'll help you. Come on, Aoi!\N- Oh, that's okay.}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.57,0:08:53.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Phiền cháu quá, đang trên đường về vậy mà.{Sorry. And you were on your way home, too.}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.79,0:08:54.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Không sao ạ.{Not at all. I'll be at the meeting, too, so...}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.44,0:08:56.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Cháu cũng tham gia buổi họp mặt mà.{Not at all. I'll be at the meeting, too, so...}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.26,0:08:58.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Akane này,{Oh, Akane, would you like to eat a pear?}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.34,0:08:59.28,Default,,0,0,0,,thích ăn lê không?{Oh, Akane, would you like to eat a pear?}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.03,0:09:01.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Thích lắm ạ!{Sure, I'd love one!}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.12,0:09:03.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Chị cháu giỏi thật đấy.{You have a wonderful big sister.}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.53,0:09:05.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Hãy biết ơn chị ấy nhé, Aoi.{Be grateful, Aoi.}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.08,0:09:08.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Cứ mỗi khi nghe đến việc "phải biết ơn", {When people tell me to "be grateful” all the time,\Nit makes me want to rebel instead.}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.64,0:09:10.92,Default,,0,0,0,,thì mình lại muốn...{When people tell me to "be grateful” all the time,\Nit makes me want to rebel instead.}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.92,0:09:12.43,Default,,0,0,0,,làm chuyện ngược lại.{When people tell me to "be grateful” all the time,\Nit makes me want to rebel instead.}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.65,0:09:15.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Thật ra...{Yeah, the miso potato cart\Nshould have different kinds of flavors.}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.68,0:09:20.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Một bát súp miso khoai tây cần có nhiều hương vị khác nhau nữa,{Yeah, the miso potato cart\Nshould have different kinds of flavors.}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.22,0:09:23.39,Default,,0,0,0,,như miso với yuzu hay miso với ngũ vị hương chẳng hạn.{Like miso mixed with yuzu,\Nor mixed with seven spices.}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.48,0:09:24.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Nhưng mà,{But will people actually come\Nto something like this?}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.27,0:09:26.64,Default,,0,0,0,,có thật là sẽ có người đến không?{But will people actually come\Nto something like this?}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.76,0:09:29.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Sao bác lại bi quan vậy?{Why are you being so pessimistic?}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.56,0:09:33.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Ở lĩnh vực này, thành phố đã thu hút hết khách du lịch, tham quan còn gì.{In this area, the city has been stealing\Nall of the tourists, even with sightseeing.}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.07,0:09:37.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Giờ là lúc chúng ta cần phải xây dựng vị thế của riêng mình.{From here on out,\Nwe need to plant our own flag.}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.93,0:09:38.62,Default,,0,0,0,1,Đúng đấy.{Yeah! We have to catch a big wave,\Nor it'll be our loss.}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.62,0:09:40.70,Default,,0,0,0,1,Bây giờ hoặc không bao giờ.{Yeah! We have to catch a big wave,\Nor it'll be our loss.}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.88,0:09:44.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Dù gì thì Masamichi Cục du lịch cũng đã tài trợ cho chúng ta còn gì.{After all, the Tourism Bureau's very own\NMasamichi put up funds for us.}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.83,0:09:45.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Chính xác!{Exactly!}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.87,0:09:50.34,Default,,0,0,0,1,Ở tòa thị chính, còn có tin đồn cậu ta đang chạy chọt khắp nơi nữa đấy.{Even at City Hall, it's rumored that\Nhe's moving around quite a lot of this.そうそう 結構 コレ 動いたらしいって市役所でも噂なんですよ ー}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.35,0:09:51.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Đừng tung tin nhảm, Akane!{Don't spread false rumors, Akane!}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.09,0:09:53.59,Default,,0,0,0,,{What, so it's not true?}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.67,0:09:55.01,Default,,0,0,0,,{I bet there's plenty of funds.}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.09,0:09:56.51,Default,,0,0,0,,{Look, you have to understand.}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.59,0:10:01.97,Default,,0,0,0,,{In addition to bringing in a singer and band\Nfrom outside, we the locals should...}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.35,0:10:04.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Chị Aoi không tham gia à?{Why don't you participate, Ao?}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.31,0:10:08.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Nếu là dùng để đổi mới bộ mặt thành phố, {If it's used for a town renewal project,\Nthen it's not music anymore.町おこしになんて利用されたら}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.75,0:10:10.77,Default,,0,0,0,,thì đó chẳng còn là âm nhạc nữa,{If it's used for a town renewal project,\Nthen it's not music anymore.それはすでに音楽じやないよ}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.11,0:10:13.12,Default,,0,0,0,,không còn gì là "thưởng thức" nữa.{That's not enjoying the sound."音を楽しむ" んじゃない}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.12,0:10:16.32,Default,,0,0,0,1,Nó chỉ là một thứ nhạc nhẽo chán ngắt mà thôi.{Instead of music to your ears,\Nit's music that bores to tears.}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.24,0:10:21.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Những gì chị vừa nói không hề hay ho như chị nghĩ đâu.{You may think you said something clever,\Nbut you didn't.}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.79,0:10:25.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Nói tóm lại,{Anyway, this town will be reborn\Nthrough music!}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.06,0:10:28.02,Default,,0,0,0,,âm nhạc sẽ làm hồi sinh thành phố này.{Anyway, this town will be reborn\Nthrough music!とにかく ここいらは 音楽によつて 生まれ変わんだよ!}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.84,0:10:34.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Aoi!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.78,0:10:35.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Tsugu!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.80,0:10:37.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Ba.{Dad.}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.28,0:10:43.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Hôm nay mấy đứa lại đến căn nhà gỗ để tập à? {Uh, so are you going to practice again\Nat the hall today?}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.22,0:10:45.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Đến 9h thì dọn dẹp đi nhé.{Just wrap it up by 9:00 p.m.}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.91,0:10:49.85,Default,,0,0,0,1,Âm bass của em nó vang vọng nghe rợn người thế nào ấy.{The low tone of your bass\Nreverbs a bit, and it sounds creepy.}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.98,0:10:55.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Ở nhà anh có một phòng cách âm đấy.{I have a soundproof room at my house.}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.32,0:10:59.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Em không muốn có anh rể à?{You don't want a big brother?}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.99,0:11:03.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Chậm lại ba ơi.{Come on, Dad, slow your roll.}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.41,0:11:05.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Em không để chị lấy người đã ly dị đâu.{I won't let her marry anyone\Nwho's been divorced.}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.74,0:11:10.25,Default,,0,0,0,1,Là do bị cô ta cắm sừng nên anh mới trở thành nạn nhân đấy chứ.{I'm a victim! My wife cheated on me!\NI'm a divorcee with a halo!}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.56,0:11:11.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Em không cần biết.{Doesn't matter.知らんがな}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.82,0:11:14.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Này, Aoi!{Hey, Aoi!}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.34,0:11:17.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Em có nhớ Shinno không?{Do you remember Shinno?}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.57,0:11:21.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Nhớ mang máng.{Oh. Vaguely.}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.76,0:11:22.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Sao vậy?{Why?}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.68,0:11:25.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Nếu em không nhớ cũng không sao?{Oh, if you don't remember, that's okay.}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.52,0:11:46.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Chuyện ba nói lúc nãy,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.12,0:11:52.08,Default,,0,0,0,,em cũng không đồng ý.{I don't agree with it either.}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.94,0:11:53.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Nhưng mà,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.05,0:11:55.36,Default,,0,0,0,,thật ra thì...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.54,0:11:58.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Đừng đề cập đến chuyện đó ở đây.{Don't talk about that here.}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.76,0:12:00.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Vậy ở nơi khác thì được đúng không?{So we can talk about it if it's not here?}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.72,0:12:04.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Ý chị không phải như vậy,{I'd rather not but...}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.05,0:12:07.43,Default,,0,0,0,,nhưng ít nhất không phải ở đây.{it would be better than here.}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.68,0:12:09.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Sai rồi.{Wrong.}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.02,0:12:10.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Như vầy này,{Here. You have to hold it down tight.}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.68,0:12:12.35,Default,,0,0,0,,em phải giữ chặt vào.{Here. You have to hold it down tight.}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.23,0:12:16.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Aoi này,{Oh, hey Ao, 1 just noticed\Nyou have a mole in the white of your eye.}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.14,0:12:17.18,Default,,0,0,0,,giờ mới để ý,{Oh, hey Ao, 1 just noticed\Nyou have a mole in the white of your eye.}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.55,0:12:19.36,Default,,0,0,0,,em có nốt ruồi ở trong mắt trái.{Oh, hey Ao, I just noticed\Nyou have a mole in the white of your eye.}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.07,0:12:22.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Giống anh này.{Same with me!}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.93,0:12:25.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Nó là dấu hiệu cho thấy ta sẽ trở nên nổi tiếng.{A mole in the eyeball\NiS a sign we're going to become big shots.}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.62,0:12:28.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Chúng ta chính là những "Mắt sao" đấy.{We're both eyeball stars.}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.95,0:12:30.29,Default,,0,0,0,,"Mắt sao".{Eyeball stars!}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.12,0:12:34.37,Default,,0,0,0,1,Đặt tên như vậy thì làm sao người khác hiểu được chứ?{What's with that name? No one would get it.}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.46,0:12:35.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Có sao đâu!{What? It's cool!}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.73,0:12:36.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Ngầu thế còn gì?{What? It's cool!}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.79,0:12:37.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Ngầu!{It's cool!}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.60,0:12:53.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Có phải Nitobe Dankichi biểu diễn ở cuộc thi hát đầu năm không?{Dankichi Nitobe is the one who performed\Nin the New Year's TV song contest, right?}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.77,0:12:54.88,Default,,0,0,0,,À.{Yeah, I kind of remember.}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.88,0:12:55.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Tớ nhớ rồi.{Yeah, I kind of remember.}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.34,0:12:58.93,Default,,0,0,0,1,Ông ấy có một sàn diễn di động kì lạ và lòe loẹt.{He rode in a weird, flashy portable shrine.}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.94,0:13:00.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Ừm.{Oh, I saw that one, too.}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.09,0:13:01.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Tớ cũng thấy vậy.{Oh, I saw that one, too.}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.65,0:13:05.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Ta sẽ nhờ ông ấy sáng tác một bài hát về thành phố trong sự kiện lần này.{To go with this event, we're going to have him\Nwrite a song about the area.}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.99,0:13:09.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Ông ấy sẽ sử dụng như câu như là "Pháo hoa tành tành",{He'll use the phrase\N“fireworks go boom-boom" in the lyrics}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.20,0:13:12.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Và khi hát, nó sẽ là màn "Pháo hoa tành tành tành" thực sự.{and when he sings it,\Nreal fireworks will go boom-boom-boom!}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.33,0:13:13.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Pháo hoa à?{Fireworks? Wow.}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.50,0:13:16.00,Default,,0,0,0,1,Vậy là cậu đã chi ra rất nhiều đúng không?{So that means you really did move a lot of this.}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.88,0:13:16.76,Top dialog,,0,0,0,1,Đây sẽ là ...{So that means you really did move a lot of this.}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.21,0:13:19.22,Default,,0,0,0,,một tác phẩm nghệ thuật...{This will be... my opus.\NTh-The opus I'm staking my life on.}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.22,0:13:20.57,Default,,0,0,0,,mà tớ...{This will be... my opus.\NTh-The opus I'm staking my life on.}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.57,0:13:21.25,Default,,0,0,0,,đã..{This will be... my opus.\NTh-The opus I'm staking my life on.}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.32,0:13:23.76,Default,,0,0,0,,dành cả đời để theo đuổi.{This will be... my opus.\NTh-The opus I'm staking my life on.}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.18,0:13:29.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Vậy nên sự kiện lần này nhờ cậu giúp đỡ nhé, Akane.{So I'm counting on your help\Nwith this event, Akane.}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.68,0:13:33.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Tớ đã nói với bên phòng dân sự rồi.{I already cleared it with the Civic Life Bureau.}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.68,0:13:34.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Cậu nghe rồi đấy.{So I've heard. Good luck, Ms. Aioi.}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.83,0:13:35.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Cố lên nhé.{So I've heard. Good luck, Ms. Aioi.}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.74,0:13:36.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Aioi.{So I've heard. Good luck, Ms. Aioi.}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.02,0:13:37.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Đợi...{Wait!}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.40,0:13:38.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Nakamura,{Nakamura, the meeting's going to start!}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.43,0:13:39.36,Default,,0,0,0,,chuẩn bị họp này! {Nakamura, the meeting's going to start!}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.19,0:13:42.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Chi tiết tớ sẽ nói sau nhé!{I'll give you the details later!}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.87,0:13:44.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Đợi đã, Michinko! {Wait a second, Michinko!}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.69,0:13:47.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Dù sao tụi mình cũng không quá bận.{Well, we're not very busy right now anyway,\Nso give it your best!}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.32,0:13:49.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Cố lên nhé.{Well, we're not very busy right now anyway,\Nso give it your best!}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.91,0:13:58.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Chị biết ông Michinko thích chị mà phải không?{You do know that Michinko likes you, right?}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.19,0:14:01.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Ừm...{Well...}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.88,0:14:04.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Đừng làm gì để ông ấy hiểu lầm đấy nhé.{You shouldn't do anything to lead him on.}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.18,0:14:11.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Cậu ấy là một người bạn cũ,{He's an old friend\Nand we work at the same place.}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.96,0:14:13.56,Default,,0,0,0,,cả hai làm chung một chỗ.{He's an old friend\Nand we work at the same place.}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.97,0:14:16.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Cho dù biết tình cảm của cậu ấy,{Even if I know he has feelings for me,}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.52,0:14:18.73,Default,,0,0,0,,vẫn có những thứ không thể nói ra được.{there are things that mustn't be said.}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.26,0:14:21.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Làm người lớn là vậy đấy.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.73,0:14:25.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Chán chết đi được.{Being an adult is so boring.}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.20,0:14:28.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Ngoài chuyện đó ra,{That aside...}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.78,0:14:32.33,Default,,0,0,0,,em thử nghĩ kĩ một lần nữa xem.{Why don't you think about it once more?}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.12,0:14:34.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Đại học ấy.{College.}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.29,0:14:38.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Em có thể vừa học vừa lập ban nhạc cũng được mà.{You can study and still be in a band.}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.29,0:14:40.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Chẳng phải ta đã thống nhất rồi sao?{We've already been through this.}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.13,0:14:44.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Chị đã hứa sẽ không hỏi em vụ đó nữa rồi mà.{You promised to stop bugging me about it.}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.86,0:14:48.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Chị đừng thất hứa chứ.{Don't break your promise.}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.39,0:14:54.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Vậy em đi tập đây.{Okay, I'm going to go practice.}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.16,0:16:01.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Dừng lại đi!{Stop that!}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.86,0:16:03.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Chơi gì kì vậy?{Where the hell did that come from?}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.83,0:16:06.25,Default,,0,0,0,1,Cả nhịp lẫn giai điệu cứ loạn xạ cả lên!{And your rhythm and timing are gross!}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.65,0:16:13.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Ai vậy?{Who are you?}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.89,0:16:18.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Này.{Hey.}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.38,0:16:21.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Chúng ta chính là những "Mắt sao". {Were both Eyeball stars.}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.07,0:16:24.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Shin... no?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.90,0:16:27.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Cậu biết tôi à?{You know me?\NHey, that's my school's uniform.}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.07,0:16:29.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Đó đồng phục trường mình mà.{You know me?\NHey, that's my school's uniform.}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.17,0:16:31.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Không lẽ,{Maybe you're one of my fans?}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.41,0:16:32.78,Default,,0,0,0,,cậu là fan của tôi à?{Maybe you're one of my fans?}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.03,0:16:34.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Muốn bắt tay không?{You wanna shake hands?}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.82,0:16:37.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.71,0:16:38.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Hả?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.95,0:16:45.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Đúng là...{So you are Shinno...}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.01,0:16:46.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Shinno.{So you are Shinno...}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.38,0:16:47.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Tôi đã nói rồi mà!{of course I am! And who are you?}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.73,0:16:48.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Vậy, cậu là...{of course I am! And who are you?}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.12,0:16:50.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Chị Akane!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.29,0:16:50.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Đợi...{Hey, wait! Hey!}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.53,0:16:51.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Này,{Hey, wait! Hey!}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.85,0:16:52.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Đợi đã.{Hey, wait! Hey!}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.78,0:16:54.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Đợi chút đã!{I said, hold on!}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.60,0:17:00.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Gì thế này?{Hey, what is this?}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.03,0:17:06.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Cái quái gì vậy?{Wh-What the hell is this?}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.00,0:17:07.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Này!{Hey, let me out of here!}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.96,0:17:09.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Cho tôi ra khỏi đây!{Hey, let me out of here!}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.78,0:17:19.49,Default,,0,0,0,,C-chị  Akane!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.39,0:17:21.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Em tập xong rồi à?{Huh? Are you done practicing already?}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.87,0:17:23.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Tối nay có món thịt băm em thích đấy!{I'm making your favorite for tonight,\Nminced meat--}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.96,0:17:25.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Anh Shinno...{Sh-Shinno is...}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.12,0:17:28.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Xin lỗi!{Sorry!}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.60,0:17:30.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Vậy...{So what about Shinno?}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.51,0:17:32.00,Default,,0,0,0,,anh Shinno sao cơ?{So what about Shinno?}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.07,0:17:35.05,Default,,0,0,0,,À không...{Um... Right!\NI was practicing and suddenly thought of him.}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.05,0:17:35.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Đúng rồi,{Um... Right!\NI was practicing and suddenly thought of him.}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.91,0:17:38.52,Default,,0,0,0,,trong lúc tập em đột nhiên nghĩ tới anh ấy.{Um... Right!\NI was practicing and suddenly thought of him.}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.22,0:17:41.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Không biết giờ anh ấy thế nào nhỉ?{I was wondering how he's doing.\NThat's all, really.}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.52,0:17:43.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Chỉ có vậy thôi.{I was wondering how he's doing.\NThat's all, really.}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.17,0:17:47.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Lâu rồi chị không nghe tin tức về cậu ấy.{I haven't heard from him in ages.}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.54,0:17:51.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Không biết giờ cậu ấy còn sống không nữa.{I don't even know if he's alive or dead.}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.83,0:17:57.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Đúng rồi, đó cũng là một khả năng.{I see. So there was that possibility, too.}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.82,0:17:59.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Nhưng chỉ có thể là vậy thôi.{In fact that's the only possibility!}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.82,0:18:00.50,Default,,0,0,0,,{After all, he hasn't changed one bit}Bởi vì...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.10,0:18:03.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Anh ấy có thay đổi chút nào đâu.{After all, he hasn't changed one bit}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.66,0:18:04.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Aoi?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.50,0:18:08.08,Default,,0,0,0,1,Hai người để cửa mở này.{Hey, you left your front door open.}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.26,0:18:09.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Bất cẩn thật đấy.{That's careless.}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.00,0:18:10.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Michinko?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.77,0:18:13.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Hai chị em còn làm gì ở đây vậy?{Wait, what are you two doing?}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.55,0:18:14.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Làm gì à?{- What're we doing?\N- Making din--}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.87,0:18:15.48,Top dialog,,0,0,0,,Làm bữa tối...{- What're we doing?\N- Making din--}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.11,0:18:16.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Không còn thời gian đâu!{This is no time for that!}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.93,0:18:19.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Tớ cần cậu giúp bên sự kiện.{I need help with the event!}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.68,0:18:20.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Cái đó tớ biết rồi.{Yes, I heard, but...}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.98,0:18:23.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Tớ không nói cậu là hôm này à?{Huh? I didn't tell you about today?}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.76,0:18:24.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Hôm nay?{Today?}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.77,0:18:26.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Thôi bỏ đi! Nhanh đi thôi nào!{Never mind! We need to get moving!}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.85,0:18:34.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Khi ông ấy đến thì đưa cao tấm băng rôn này một cách thật hào hứng nhé{When he gets here, hold this up high,\Nwith all the gusto you can muster!}.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.31,0:18:35.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Ba này,{So this is what\Nyou were working on last night?}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.36,0:18:38.03,Default,,0,0,0,,tối qua ba thức khuya là để chuẩn bị cái này hả?{So this is what\Nyou were working on last night?}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.14,0:18:38.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Này,{Hey, don't spill any miso on it!}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.69,0:18:40.41,Default,,0,0,0,,cẩn thận tương miso đấy.{Hey, don't spill any miso on it!}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.41,0:18:40.99,Top dialog,,0,0,0,,Thật là,{- Sheesh. I shouldn't even be here.\N- But why is he coming today?}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.99,0:18:43.66,Top dialog,,0,0,0,,đáng lý ra ta không nên ở đây.{- Sheesh. I shouldn't even be here.\N- But why is he coming today?}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.00,0:18:43.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Nhưng sao lại đến hôm nay vậy?{- Sheesh. I shouldn't even be here.\N- But why is he coming today?}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.98,0:18:45.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Tuần sau mới đến sự kiện mà.{The event is a week from now, right?}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.70,0:18:46.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Chuyện là vầy...{The thing is...}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.98,0:18:50.08,Default,,0,0,0,,thầy Nitobe là chuyên gia về các bài hát địa phương,{Mr. Nitobe is the authority\Non local songs, right?}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.17,0:18:54.25,Default,,0,0,0,,ông ấy muốn trải nghiệm những món ăn và con người ở vùng đất này,{He said something like not being able\Nto sing about the soul of the land}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.55,0:18:57.59,Default,,0,0,0,,khi đó mới có thể hát về nó bằng cả trái tim được.{unless he first samples the local food\Nand mingles with the people.}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.67,0:19:00.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Tòa thị chính chi trả cho việc đó chứ gì?{And City Hall is paying for that, huh?}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.67,0:19:05.22,Default,,0,0,0,1,Cái đấy chẳng phải người ta gọi là ăn chực sao? {That's definitely what you call\Nsponging off someone, right?}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.01,0:19:06.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Tsugu?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.52,0:19:12.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Cái...{What the...}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.21,0:19:20.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Xin lỗi đã để quý vị phải chờ lâu.{Ladies and gentlemen, thank you for waiting.}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.32,0:19:21.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Kẻ cô độc,{One lone man, Dankichi Nitobe,}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.49,0:19:23.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Nitobe Dankichi này,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.74,0:19:30.37,Default,,0,0,0,,đã băng qua những cách đồng và những ngọn núi xa xôi để mang đến món quà nụ cười cho quý vị đây.{has crossed fields from afar and traversed\Nmountains to bring you the gift of a smile.}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.46,0:19:32.42,Default,,0,0,0,1,C-Cú lừa à?{- A f-feint?\N- Is that Dan?}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.92,0:19:34.92,Default,,0,0,0,,{- The real one?\N- What's he doing here?}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.75,0:19:38.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Akane?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.44,0:19:52.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Đây là...{If I was able to meet you...\NI-is that...}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.40,0:19:54.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Shinno.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.77,0:19:55.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Nào Tsugu!{Come on, Tsugu! Hold it up high!}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.93,0:19:57.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Đưa cao lên!{Come on, Tsugu! Hold it up high!}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.44,0:20:23.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Chờ chút đã, chị Aoi!{Hey, Ao!}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.52,0:20:33.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Ba,{Mom, Dad, and all of my ancestors,\Nplease give me strength!}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.32,0:20:34.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Mẹ,{Mom, Dad, and all of my ancestors,\Nplease give me strength!}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.22,0:20:35.96,Default,,0,0,0,,và tất cả dòng họ tổ tiên.{Mom, Dad, and all of my ancestors,\Nplease give me strength!}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.39,0:20:38.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Xin hãy cho con sức mạnh.{Mom, Dad, and all of my ancestors,\Nplease give me strength!}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.44,0:20:39.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Thật là.{Man.}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.15,0:20:42.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Chị Aoi,{Ao, the taxi driver gave me an invoice.\NWhat do ...}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.00,0:20:43.96,Default,,0,0,0,,tài xế đưa hóa đơn này.{Ao, the taxi driver gave me an invoice.\NWhat do ...}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.43,0:20:46.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Này.{Hey.}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.95,0:20:52.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Có thật là người tên Shinno ấy đã ở đấy không?{So that "Shinno" person was really in there?}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.50,0:20:55.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Chị cứ nghĩ anh ấy là ma.{I thought he was a ghost,}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.87,0:20:56.46,Default,,0,0,0,,nhưng mà,{but 1 saw the real Shinno at the station,\Nso what did 1 see here?}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.46,0:20:58.88,Default,,0,0,0,,ta đã gặp Shinno thật ở nhà ga,{but 1 saw the real Shinno at the station,\Nso what did 1 see here?}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.88,0:21:00.42,Default,,0,0,0,,vậy người chị đã gặp là ai?{but 1 saw the real Shinno at the station,\Nso what did I see here?}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.97,0:21:02.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Người giống người chăng?{A lookalike?}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.47,0:21:04.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Chị không biết,{I don't understand it,\Nbut he was definitely Shinno, too.}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.05,0:21:06.39,Default,,0,0,0,,nhưng đó nhất định cũng là Shinno.{I don't understand it,\Nbut he was definitely Shinno, too.}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.57,0:21:09.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Chị không hiểu tại sao nhưng có gì đó lạ lắm!{I don't get it,\Nbut something really weird is going on!}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.33,0:21:13.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Thế nào?{Well?}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.06,0:21:16.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Không có ai ở đây cả.{Nobody's here.}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.17,0:21:19.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Không thể nào.{That can't be...}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.78,0:21:22.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Này,{Why did you run away from me?}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.67,0:21:23.98,Default,,0,0,0,,sao cậu lại bỏ chạy hả?{Why did you run away from me?}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.16,0:21:27.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Chị Ao?{- Ao? L-Let go of her!\N- Whoa.}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.31,0:21:28.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Thả chị ấy ra!{- Ao? L-Let go of her!\N- Whoa.}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.70,0:21:31.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Nhóc nào đây,{Huh? Who's this kid?\NHe looks just like Michinko.}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.73,0:21:33.05,Default,,0,0,0,,giống hệt Michinko.{Huh? Who's this kid?\NHe looks just like Michinko.}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.50,0:21:38.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Anh là thứ gì vậy?{What are you?}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.20,0:21:39.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Đã bảo tôi là Shinno rồi mà.{I said, I'm Shinno!}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.96,0:21:41.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Thế mấy người là ai?{Who the hell are you?}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.85,0:21:42.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Chị Aoi.{Ao, for now, run away.}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.89,0:21:43.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Chị chạy trước đi.{Ao, for now, run away.}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.34,0:21:46.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Chị Aoi à?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.77,0:21:49.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Aioi Aoi.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.94,0:21:52.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Mắt sao số 2.{Eyeball star number two.}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.91,0:22:01.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Lúc đấy,{That day, Akane told me\Nshe wasn't going to Tokyo.}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.15,0:22:03.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Akane bảo không lên Tokyo với anh nữa.{That day, Akane told me\Nshe wasn't going to Tokyo.}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.00,0:22:07.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Anh...{I felt like I couldn't go home.}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.57,0:22:09.11,Default,,0,0,0,,chả muốn về nhà nữa.{I felt like I couldn't go home.}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.53,0:22:15.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Anh vào đây và nghĩ về một số chuyện.{For some reason, I was here\Nand thought about a lot of things.}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.45,0:22:16.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Và rồi...{And the next thing 1 knew...}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.68,0:22:17.78,Default,,0,0,0,,đến khi tỉnh lại...{And the next thing I knew...}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.28,0:22:20.79,Default,,0,0,0,,thì trời sáng mất tiêu.{it was morning?}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.38,0:22:22.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Nghe đáng ngờ vậy.{Why is that a question?}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.59,0:22:24.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Anh cũng có biết đâu.{I don't get it either.}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.48,0:22:30.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Nhưng anh thấy rất ểu oải nên cứ nằm đấy cho đến khi bị tiếng tạp âm chói tai đánh thức.{But I felt sluggish, so I was zoning out there\Nwhen this awful cacophony woke me up.}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.83,0:22:31.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Tạp âm?{Cacophony?}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.76,0:22:36.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Thực sự là anh cảm giác như chỉ mới ngủ dậy thôi,{I swear, it feels like I just got up, so when\Nyou tell me it's 13 years later, it's confusing.}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.75,0:22:39.12,Default,,0,0,0,,khi hai đứa bảo đây là tương lai 13 năm sau,{I swear, it feels like I just got up, so when\Nyou tell me it's 13 years later, it's confusing.}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.55,0:22:41.15,Default,,0,0,0,,anh cảm thấy rất bối rối.{I swear, it feels like I just got up, so when\Nyou tell me it's 13 years later, it's confusing.}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.44,0:22:42.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Em hiểu rồi.{I see. You're like Rip Van Winkle.}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.33,0:22:44.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Như Urashima Taro vậy.{I see. You're like Rip Van Winkle."Rip Van Winkle" là một nhân vật hư cấu trong truyện ngắn nổi tiếng cùng tên của nhà văn Mỹ Washington Irving (1783-1859).}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.11,0:22:46.03,Default,,0,0,0,1,Chuyện này...{Is that even...}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.19,0:22:47.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Nhưng mà,{Oh well. If time has passed,\Nthere's nothing I can do about it.}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.70,0:22:50.66,Default,,0,0,0,,thời gian đã qua đi thì cũng chả làm gì được..{Oh well. If time has passed,\Nthere's nothing I can do about it.}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.89,0:22:52.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Anh chấp nhận nhanh quá nhỉ?{You're quick to accept a weird situation.}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.05,0:22:53.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Không.{Nah, I'm accepting it thanks to you.}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.08,0:22:57.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Hai đứa đã giúp anh ngộ ra đấy.{Nah, I'm accepting it thanks to you.}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:58.03,0:23:00.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Nhìn nhóc như là Michinko nhỏ ấy.{You're obviously a miniature Michinko.}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.65,0:23:01.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Vô tư quá nhỉ?{He's happy-go-lucky.}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:01.79,0:23:03.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Ít nhất,{At least we know he's not a ghost.\NHe has a physical form.}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:03.23,0:23:04.61,Default,,0,0,0,,anh ấy không phải là ma,{At least we know he's not a ghost.\NHe has a physical form.}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.61,0:23:05.56,Default,,0,0,0,,mà vẫn đang sống.{At least we know he's not a ghost.\NHe has a physical form.}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.09,0:23:06.94,Default,,0,0,0,,V-Vậy sao?{I see. But then...}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.47,0:23:09.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Nhưng giờ thì sao?{I see. But then...}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:11.43,0:23:12.92,Default,,0,0,0,1,Có thể anh là linh hồn sống.{Maybe a living spirit...}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:12.93,0:23:14.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Linh hồn sống.{Living spirit?}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:14.31,0:23:16.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Anh biết mà phải không?{You've heard of it, right?}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:16.52,0:23:18.84,Default,,0,0,0,1,Vì một cảm xúc mãnh liệt dành cho ai đó,{Một phần linh hồn của anh rời khỏi thân xác...When you have strong feelings\Ntowards someone,}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.84,0:23:22.04,Default,,0,0,0,1,mà một phần linh hồn của anh sẽ rời khỏi thân xác.{mà một phần linh hồn rời khỏi thân xác mà anh không biết}{vì những cảm xúc mãnh liệt mà anh dành cho một ai đó.a spirit spawned from those feelings\Nleaves your body without you realizing it.}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:22.09,0:23:25.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Và rồi sau đó sẽ đặt lời nguyền lên người khác đúng không? {I've heard about that!\NThe spirit puts a deadly curse on that person!}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.61,0:23:29.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Bởi vì chị Akane đã từ chối anh Shinno mà.{It's because Akane turned Shinno down, so...}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.85,0:23:32.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Có lẽ vì thế mà anh được sinh ra không chừng.{Maybe you were born\Nfrom those unresolved feelings.}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.95,0:23:34.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Mấy đứa nói gì thế?{What are you talking about?}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.30,0:23:36.98,Default,,0,0,0,1,Dù là gì đi nữa,{Unresolved feelings or whatever,\NI haven't given up.}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.98,0:23:39.54,Default,,0,0,0,,thì anh vẫn chưa bỏ cuộc đâu.{Unresolved feelings or whatever,\NI haven't given up.}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.72,0:23:42.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Sau khi suy nghĩ kĩ thì anh đã thông rồi.{After thinking about it, I made up my mind.}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:43.00,0:23:46.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Đầu tiên là lên Tokyo, trở thành nhạc công nổi tiếng.{First I'll go to Tokyo\Nand become a big musician!}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:46.34,0:23:49.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Sau đó sẽ trở về với Akane thật hoành tráng.{Then I'll come back for Akane\Nwith all this fanfare!}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:49.84,0:23:50.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Lạc quan quá vậy.{He's so excessively positive.}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:51.10,0:23:51.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Ấy vậy mà,{So why did this have to happen?}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:51.87,0:23:54.72,Default,,0,0,0,,sao lại xảy ra chuyện này chứ?{So why did this have to happen?}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:55.09,0:23:55.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Akane...{Akane must be 31 by now, right?}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:55.84,0:23:57.43,Default,,0,0,0,,giờ chắc 31 tuổi rồi nhỉ.{Akane must be 31 by now, right?}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:57.59,0:24:00.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Khoan, 30...31...{Wait, so 31... Then... 30...}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:00.52,0:24:02.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Mà Akane vẫn chưa kết hôn phải không?{Hey, Akane isn't married, is she?}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:03.27,0:24:03.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Tuyệt.{- No.\N- All right!}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:05.01,0:24:06.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Không nên vui mừng vì việc đó nhỉ?{Wait, I shouldn't be happy about that.}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:07.11,0:24:08.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Mình phải nhanh lên không thì...{I have to hurry and gel...}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:08.98,0:24:10.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Anh muốn gặp chị ấy không?{Do you want to see her?}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:10.84,0:24:11.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Em bị ngốc à?{- Are you an idiot? I can't see her like this!\N- Idiot? What a jerk.}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:11.90,0:24:13.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Giờ sao mà gặp cậu ấy được?{- Are you an idiot? I can't see her like this!\N- Idiot? What a jerk.}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:13.78,0:24:16.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Em có nghe anh nói không vậy?{Weren't you listening to me?}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:16.12,0:24:18.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Phải là nhạc công nổi tiếng đã...{I have to become a big musician first.}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:18.04,0:24:21.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Không rõ là nổi hay không nhưng giờ anh đang là nhạc công mà nhỉ?{I don't know if he's big or not,\Nbut he did become a musician, right?}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:22.46,0:24:23.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Ừm.{Oh, true, your 31-year-old self\Ndid become a musician, in a way.}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:23.26,0:24:28.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Đúng là anh 31 tuổi hiện giờ đã trở thành một nhạc công rồi.{Oh, true, your 31-year-old self\Ndid become a musician, in a way.}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:31.35,0:24:32.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Tuyệt vời!{That's awesome!}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:33.80,0:24:35.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Anh sẽ trở lại ngay!{I'll be right back!}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:37.00,0:24:37.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Tạm biệt!{- Hey!\N- See you!}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:46.63,0:24:48.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Đây có lẽ là định mệnh nhỉ?{Wow, so this must be fate, huh?}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:48.65,0:24:50.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Em cũng bất ngờ lắm.{I was surprised, too.}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:50.23,0:24:54.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Vì nghĩ thầy sẽ là lựa chọn hàng đầu để có một sáng tác cho địa phương,{I thought you would be\Nour best choice to create a local song for us,}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:54.49,0:24:57.03,Default,,0,0,0,1,nên em mới thu thập cảnh quay để hỏi ý thầy.{so I was gathering footage\Nin preparation to ask you,}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:57.49,0:25:00.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Nào ngờ gặp lại bạn cũ ở trong band dự bị.{and I was surprised 10 see\Nmy old buddy in the backup band!}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:00.49,0:25:01.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Shinno nhỉ?{Right, Shinno?}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:01.55,0:25:02.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Đau đấy.{That hurt.}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:02.83,0:25:06.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Đối với Shinnosuke, đây sẽ là buổi diễn hồi hương vẻ vang.{For Shinnosuke, this will be\Na triumphant homecoming performance.}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:06.83,0:25:09.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Cậu ta sẽ có một màn solo guitar để tỏa sáng.{I'll have to give him a guitar solo\NSo he can shine.}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:10.35,0:25:11.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Sướng vậy,{Nice! Let me do a solo, too!}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:11.38,0:25:13.38,Default,,0,0,0,,em cũng muốn có một màn solo nữa.{Nice! Let me do a solo, too!}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:13.38,0:25:16.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Tiếng sax của cậu vẫn còn non lắm.{You guys, that's still mostly raw. Your sax doesn't have enough soul in it.}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:16.51,0:25:18.22,Default,,0,0,0,,{Excuse me, another plate\Nof this firm kind of meat.}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:18.30,0:25:21.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Vậy cậu đã nói với Aoi việc Shinno trở về à?{So you told Aoi that Shinno was coming back?}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:22.14,0:25:23.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Cậu vừa nói gì à, Akane?{Did you say something, Akane?}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:26.69,0:25:29.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Hai người đang hẹn hò à?{Are you two together?}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:30.77,0:25:32.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Thầy muốn nghĩ sao cũng được ạ.{Well, I'll leave that to your imagination.}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:32.78,0:25:34.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Này, Michinko.{Hey, Michinko.}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:35.96,0:25:36.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Rượu nhạt rồi.{The booze is tasting bad now!}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:37.15,0:25:38.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Cho loại xịn hơn đi ông chủ.{- More of the expensive stuff, please!\N- And more meat!}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:38.57,0:25:39.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Thêm thịt nữa nhé.{- More of the expensive stuff, please!\N- And more meat!}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:42.46,0:25:44.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Không thể ra khỏi đây được à?{So he can't leave here?}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:44.27,0:25:46.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Vầy giống giam cầm hơn là sống đấy?{More like a bound spirit than a living spirit?}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:46.27,0:25:49.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Biết thế mà vẫn cố phi ra ngoài.{He knew that and still flung himself.}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:51.05,0:25:53.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Vậy là giấc mơ của anh đã thành hiện thực.{So my wish does come true.}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:55.72,0:25:56.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Lúc đó,{At that time, 1 thought of something.}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:56.62,0:25:57.93,Default,,0,0,0,,anh đã nghĩ.{At that time, 1 thought of something.}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:57.93,0:25:59.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Phải mau mau tốt nghiệp,{Hurry and graduate high school,\Ngo to Tokyo, race to the future,}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:59.47,0:26:01.10,Default,,0,0,0,,nhanh chóng lên Tokyo,{Hurry and graduate high school,\Ngo to Tokyo, race to the future,}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:01.10,0:26:02.97,Default,,0,0,0,,đua đến tương lai thật nhanh.{Hurry and graduate high school,\Ngo to Tokyo, race to the future,}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:03.06,0:26:04.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Để còn...{and then hurry and come back for Akane.}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:04.31,0:26:06.01,Default,,0,0,0,,trở về với Akane.{and then hurry and come back for Akane.}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:07.14,0:26:08.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Anh chỉ hi vọng,{I was hoping that day\Nwould hurry up and come.}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:08.29,0:26:10.00,Default,,0,0,0,,ngày ấy sẽ đến thật nhanh.{I was hoping that day\Nwould hurry up and come.}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:10.90,0:26:12.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Cho nên là... {So even if I am a living spirit,\Nit's definitely not because of some grudge.}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:12.14,0:26:14.32,Default,,0,0,0,,dù anh có là linh hồn sống đi nữa, {So even if I am a living spirit,\Nit's definitely not because of some grudge.}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:14.48,0:26:16.15,Default,,0,0,0,,cũng chả có gì oán hận đâu. {So even if I am a living spirit,\Nit's definitely not because of some grudge.}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:18.28,0:26:19.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Nói tóm lại,{Anyway, I don't understand,\Nbut I understand one thing.}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:19.34,0:26:20.75,Default,,0,0,0,,anh không rõ tại sao,{Anyway, I don't understand,\Nbut I understand one thing.}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:20.75,0:26:22.40,Default,,0,0,0,,nhưng anh biết một điều.{Anyway, I don't understand,\Nbut I understand one thing.}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:22.68,0:26:27.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Nếu anh tương lai và Akane quen nhau thì mọi thứ sẽ đâu vào đấy đúng không?{If the future me and Akane get together,\Neverything will fall into place, right?}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:27.94,0:26:32.13,Default,,0,0,0,1,Sau đó thì linh hồn này sẽ...BỤP...quay về với cơ thể thực sự.{Then this living spirit me will go whoosh!\NRight back into the real me's body.}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:33.96,0:26:35.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Trăm sự nhờ em đấy! Mắt sao!{I'm counting on you, eyeball star.}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:40.47,0:26:42.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Anh ấy lúc nào cũng vậy hả?{Was he always like that?}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:44.43,0:26:45.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Có lẽ.{Probably.}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:45.81,0:26:48.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Hồi đó, anh ấy có vẻ chững chạc hơn.{Back then, he seemed a little more\Nmature to me, though.}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:48.81,0:26:49.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Giờ tính sao đây?{What are you going to do?}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:50.93,0:26:52.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Nghe theo anh ấy,{Are you going to do what he said,\Nand help the two of them get together?}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:52.59,0:26:54.65,Default,,0,0,0,,ghép hai người họ với nhau hả?{Are you going to do what he said,\Nand help the two of them get together?}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:55.65,0:26:57.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Ý tưởng cũng không tệ lắm.{That may not be a bad idea.}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:57.86,0:26:58.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Vậy à?{Really?}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:58.82,0:27:00.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Thế vẫn tốt hơn là...{It's better than having Akane...}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:00.24,0:27:01.32,Default,,0,0,0,,để chị ấy...{It's better than having Akane...}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:03.83,0:27:06.83,Default,,0,0,0,,bị ràng buộc với chị ở đây mãi mãi.{stay here and be bound to me forever.}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:08.83,0:27:11.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Giờ đi tăng hai thôi nào!{Come on, let's go to the next place!\NAn after-party!}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:12.12,0:27:13.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Vâng, thầy chờ một lát.{S-Sure, just a second.}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:13.63,0:27:16.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Này, Shinnosuke, muốn "hát" thì phải đến đúng chỗ chứ. {Hey, Shinnosuke, if you're going to puke,\Ndo it in the can.}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:16.84,0:27:18.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Thịt ngon quá nhỉ?{That was some tasty meat.}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:19.26,0:27:20.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Cậu ta không ổn rồi.{- Let's go somewhere with fish.\N- Nah, he's no good.}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:21.82,0:27:23.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Chả trách cậu ấy được.{- You guys eat a lot.\N- I guess it can't be helped.}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:23.42,0:27:25.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Em vẫn chưa uống rượu,{I haven't been drinking, so I'll drive him back.}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:25.05,0:27:26.23,Default,,0,0,0,,để em đưa cậu ấy về.{I haven't been drinking, so I'll drive him back.}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:26.68,0:27:27.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Anh Masamichi,{Masamichi, I'd like to go to a place that has girls,\Nwherever the local beauties hang out.}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:27.53,0:27:30.20,Default,,0,0,0,,tiếp theo tới nơi nào có phụ nữ được không?{Masamichi, I'd like to go to a place that has girls,\Nwherever the local beauties hang out.}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:30.20,0:27:32.30,Default,,0,0,0,,chỗ có những em dễ thương ấy?{Masamichi, I'd like to go to a place that has girls,\Nwherever the local beauties hang out.}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:32.68,0:27:33.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Vâng.{Uh, sure!}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:50.11,0:27:51.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Gandhara?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:54.04,0:27:54.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Tỉnh rồi à?{You're awake?}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:57.05,0:27:58.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Mơ ước của tớ...{My dream came true, in a way, right?}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:58.37,0:28:00.22,Default,,0,0,0,,đã thành hiện thực...{My dream came true, in a way, right?}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:00.22,0:28:01.22,Default,,0,0,0,,rồi nhỉ?{My dream came true, in a way, right?}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:01.72,0:28:02.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Đúng vậy.{Yes, it did.}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:02.61,0:28:03.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Cậu làm được rồi. {Yes, it did.}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:04.89,0:28:06.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Cậu mỉa mai tớ.{You're mocking me.}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:07.22,0:28:11.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Không ngờ Shinno lại trở thành một người nghiện rượu như vậy đấy?{I'm just surprised that you turned out\Nto be a morose drunk, Shinno.}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:12.64,0:28:14.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Cậu...vẫn độc thân à?{You're single, so...}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:15.65,0:28:17.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Cậu đang mong chờ tớ đấy à?{have you been waiting for me?}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:19.74,0:28:21.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Có thật vậy không nhỉ?{Have I been waiting?}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:22.36,0:28:23.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Có lẽ...{I think...}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:23.41,0:28:24.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Không phải vậy đâu.{No, 1 don't think so.}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:29.58,0:28:31.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Tới nhà rồi.{Here we are.}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:32.08,0:28:33.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Bước đi cẩn thận,{- Walk properly, and I'll get you some water.\N- Have a drink with me, Ms. Aioi.}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:33.61,0:28:34.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Tớ đi rót nước...{- Walk properly, and I'll get you some water.\N- Have a drink with me, Ms. Aioi.}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:34.45,0:28:36.92,Top dialog,,0,0,0,,Uống với tớ đi, quý cô Aioi.{- Walk properly, and I'll get you some water.\N- Have a drink with me, Ms. Aioi.}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:37.59,0:28:39.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Đừng nói ngốc nghếch nữa.{Don't say silly things.}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:40.42,0:28:41.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Này.{Hey.}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:45.09,0:28:46.01,Default,,0,0,0,,{Ow!}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:46.88,0:28:48.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Tại sao vậy?{The hell?}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:48.60,0:28:51.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Đến tuổi này rồi mà còn làm giá sao?{Don't put on airs at your age.}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:51.10,0:28:52.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Cậu nghiêm túc đấy hả?{Are you being serious?}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:53.45,0:28:54.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Thì sao chứ?{Why not? You have nothing to lose.}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:54.14,0:28:55.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Cũng chả có gì để mất.{Why not? You have nothing to lose.}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:56.48,0:28:59.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Đó là tâm sự của cậu sau 13 năm gặp lại sao?{Is that the kind of thing to say\Nafter a 13 year reunion?}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:02.05,0:29:03.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Đừng làm tớ thất vọng chứ.{Don't disappoint me.}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:09.53,0:29:10.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Bản thân tớ,{I didn't want to come either.}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:11.44,0:29:12.87,Default,,0,0,0,,cũng đâu muốn tới đây.{I didn't want to come either.}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:14.28,0:29:17.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Với bộ dạng như bây giờ.{I didn't want to come like this, as I am now.}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:19.84,0:29:20.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Chị về rồi đây.{I'm back!}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:21.51,0:29:22.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Aoi?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:22.98,0:29:24.13,Default,,0,0,0,1,Vâng.{Welcome back. You're home early.}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:24.13,0:29:25.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Chị về sớm vậy.{Welcome back. You're home early.}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:26.68,0:29:29.76,Default,,0,0,0,1,Chị chỉ có thể đi ăn uống thôi.{I can only take so much wining and dining.}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:29.98,0:29:33.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Chắc hôm nay chị không tắm mà sẽ đi ngủ luôn.{I'm just going to go to bed\Nwithout taking a bath.}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:35.52,0:29:36.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Nè,{Hey, why don't we sleep\Nin the same room tonight?}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:36.52,0:29:38.04,Default,,0,0,0,,tối nay ngủ chung nhé.{Hey, why don't we sleep\Nin the same room tonight?}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:38.80,0:29:41.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Lâu rồi hai đứa không ngủ chung mà.{It'll be fun!\NWe haven't done that in a long time.}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:48.03,0:29:48.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Chị này,{Hey.}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:49.87,0:29:52.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Chị kể thêm về anh Kanamuro Shinnosuke đi.{Tell me about Shinnosuke Kanamuro.}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:53.62,0:29:54.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Cậu ta là một kẻ nát rượu.{He's just a drunk.}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:55.12,0:29:56.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Không phải người hiện giờ.{Not now. How he used to be.}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:56.62,0:29:57.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Trước kia cơ.{Not now. How he used to be.}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:58.35,0:30:01.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Lâu quá nên chị quên mất rồi.{It's been so long that I've forgotten.}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:01.66,0:30:03.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Trí nhớ chị kém lắm.{I have a bad memory.}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:06.70,0:30:10.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Nhưng sau ngần ấy năm, chị có bạn trai đâu.{But all these years,\Nyou haven't had a boyfriend.}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:11.38,0:30:12.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Chị có chứ,{I have. Here and there.}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:12.83,0:30:14.27,Default,,0,0,0,,có người này người kia.{I have. Here and there.}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:16.89,0:30:17.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Nói xạo,{No way! You never showed any sign of it!\NWhy didn't you ever say anything?}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:17.52,0:30:19.42,Default,,0,0,0,,em có thấy dấu hiệu nào đâu,{No way! You never showed any sign of it!\NWhy didn't you ever say anything?}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:19.42,0:30:20.76,Default,,0,0,0,,sao chị không kể em?{No way! You never showed any sign of it!\NWhy didn't you ever say anything?}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:20.76,0:30:22.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Sao thế,{What? You really are attached to me, huh, Aoi?}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:22.11,0:30:24.86,Default,,0,0,0,,em thực sự quan tâm chị đến vậy sao?{What? You really are attached to me, huh, Aoi?}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:25.65,0:30:26.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Vậy là sao?{Excuse me?}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:28.16,0:30:29.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Sao cũng được.{Whatever!}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:43.84,0:30:44.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Ngon tuyệt!{Delicious!}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:45.26,0:30:48.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Nhưng để anh ăn bữa trưa của em vậy có sao không?{But are you sure it's okay\Nfor me to eat your lunch?}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:48.75,0:30:50.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Em sẽ mua ở cửa hàng tiện lợi sau.{I'll go to the convenience store later.}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:50.90,0:30:51.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Thế à?{Yeah?}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:52.18,0:30:53.06,Default,,0,0,0,,{Vậy...}{Then...}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:57.88,0:31:00.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Anh cũng biết đói nhỉ?{So you get hungry, too, huh?}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:00.60,0:31:03.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Cũng không hẳn là đói... nhưng có thể ăn được.{I wouldn't say hungry, but... I can eat.}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:03.94,0:31:06.07,Default,,0,0,0,1,Vấn đề là ở đây chán quá.{The toughest thing is the boredom.}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:07.02,0:31:08.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Anh có guitar mà.{You've got a guitar. If you're bored...}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:08.36,0:31:09.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Nếu chán thì...{You've got a guitar. If you're bored...}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:10.08,0:31:11.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Dây rỉ hết rồi.{The strings are rusty.}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:11.41,0:31:13.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Muốn em mua bộ mới không?{Want me to buy you new ones?\NNickel, right?}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:13.02,0:31:13.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Dây Niken hả...{Want me to buy you new ones?\NNickel, right?}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:13.41,0:31:14.58,Top dialog,,0,0,0,,Thôi.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:18.24,0:31:19.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Vậy được rồi.{That's okay.}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:19.57,0:31:21.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Hay em mua cuốn Jump được không?{Instead, would you get me a copy of Jump?}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:21.66,0:31:24.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Không đọc KochiKame thấy thiếu thiếu sao ấy.{It doesn't feel right, not reading KochiKame.}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:24.66,0:31:26.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Bộ ấy hết rồi.{That series is over.}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:27.24,0:31:29.15,Default,,0,0,0,,KochiKame làm sao mà hết được.{There's no way KochiKame can be over!}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:29.15,0:31:31.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Ryo mà ra đi thì còn gì là "vĩnh hằng" nữa{If Ryo goes, then what does "eternal” mean?}?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:31.56,0:31:32.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Em không biết đâu.{Don't ask me.}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:33.16,0:31:33.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Thật hả trời?{For real?}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:34.14,0:31:35.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Ryo sẽ ở bên ai nhỉ?{Who did Ryo end up with?}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:36.82,0:31:39.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Đúng là vô tư.{This guy has no sense of tension.}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:47.46,0:31:49.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Đây...không phải Tsugu... là Michinko.{Huh? This isn't Tsugu, but Michinko?}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:49.92,0:31:52.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Hóa ra anh ấy hồi ấy trông thế này.{This is what he used to look like?}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:52.21,0:31:55.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Thảo nào Shinno cứ gọi Michinko nhỏ hoài.{No wonder Shinno called Tsugu a 'miniature.”}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:56.95,0:31:58.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Akane...
Dialogue: 0,0:32:00.11,0:32:02.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Bọn họ ở chung một lớp.{They were both in the same class.}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:11.30,0:32:13.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Học sinh tiểu học à?{Is Shinno an elementary school student?}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:13.84,0:32:15.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Chị Akane thì...
Dialogue: 0,0:32:17.88,0:32:20.46,Default,,0,0,0,1,viết về thứ gì đó, giống như mình vậy.{She wrote something that I would write.}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:28.61,0:32:33.49,Default,,0,0,0,,"Thấu hiểu sắc xanh của bầu trời" à?{'But it does know the blueness of the sky.”}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:34.49,0:32:35.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Aioi!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:37.37,0:32:39.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Cậu muốn cân nhắc lại không?{Hey, would you reconsider?}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:40.05,0:32:41.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Nếu gia nhập ban...{If you joined our band...}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:40.83,0:32:44.37,Top dialog,,0,0,0,,Tham gia một ban nhạc tệ hơn mình chỉ tổ tốn thời gian thôi.{Joining a band that sucks more than me\Nwould just be a waste of time.}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:44.79,0:32:46.33,Default,,0,0,0,1,Thái độ kiểu gì vậy?{What was that, you ugly rag?}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:46.68,0:32:49.17,Default,,0,0,0,1,Con nhỏ ấy khó chịu thật đấy!{That girl's got a nasty tongue.}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:49.39,0:32:51.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Tiếc thật.{What a waste.}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:52.22,0:32:56.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Một mình được ở trong một ban nhạc nam sướng vậy mà?{The lone woman in a boy band\Njust sounds way too good.}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:57.01,0:33:00.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Nhưng chắc cậu cũng có lý do riêng hả?{But I guess you can afford\N to pass up that opportunity}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:00.35,0:33:02.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Dù gì thì cậu cũng sẽ lên Tokyo,{After all, you're going to Tokyo\Nbecause there are older guys there, right?}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:02.38,0:33:04.74,Default,,0,0,0,1,vì ở đấy có mấy anh ngon zai hơn phải không?{After all, you're going to Tokyo\Nbecause there are older guys there, right?}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:06.86,0:33:11.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Nghe nói cậu lúc nào cũng được một anh lái xe đưa đón hả?{It's rumored that you always get picked up\Nand dropped off by a guy in a car.}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:11.48,0:33:14.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Giới thiệu tớ với bạn của bạn trai cậu đi.{Come on, introduce me\Nto your boyfriend's friends!}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:14.49,0:33:17.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Nếu chuyện không thành,tớ sẽ không trách cậu đâu.{Even if it doesn't work out,\N1 wouldn't blame you.}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:20.51,0:33:22.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Vậy...giờ cậu muốn đi theo không?{All right, do you want to come with me now?}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:26.29,0:33:29.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Tiếp đến là ngân sách cho sân khấu.{Next, about the budget for the stage--}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:28.71,0:33:29.58,Top dialog,,0,0,0,,Trước đấy,{Before that, what's this "budget for Mr. Nitobe\Nto learn to love the locale"?}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:29.58,0:33:32.96,Top dialog,,0,0,0,1,"Ngân sách để thầy Nitobe tìm hiểu về địa phương" là sao vậy?{Before that, what's this "budget for Mr. Nitobe\Nto learn to love the locale"?}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:33.05,0:33:34.55,Default,,0,0,0,,À, cái đó...{Oh, that's, well...}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:38.14,0:33:38.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Cái đó...{That's...}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:39.93,0:33:41.85,Default,,0,0,0,,là để dành cho chuyện này đây.{for something like this.}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:41.97,0:33:45.23,Default,,0,0,0,,À, thưởng thức đá bào đặc sản ở địa phương à?{Yes, shaved ice is a local specialty.}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:46.80,0:33:48.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Đá bào đến tận 18000 yên à?{Wait, 18,000 yen for shaved ice?18000 yen ~ 4tr VND}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:48.85,0:33:51.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Ông ấy bảo muốn thử hết tất cả các hương vị,{He said that unless he tries all of the flavors,\Nhe can't understand the shop owner's spirit.}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:51.95,0:33:54.65,Default,,0,0,0,1,để có thể hiểu ý tưởng chủ đạo của chủ quán. {He said that unless he tries all of the flavors,\Nhe can't understand the shop owner's spirit.}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:54.74,0:33:57.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Mong sao ông ta bị tào tháo rượt.{I hope he gets diarrhea.}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:57.57,0:33:58.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Nagatoro.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:58.57,0:34:00.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Chèo thuyền.{River boating, huh?}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:00.62,0:34:02.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Ăn trưa với thịt heo miso và soba óc chó.{Miso-marinated pork\Nand soba with walnut dipping sauce for lunch.}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:03.20,0:34:04.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Ăn nhiều cỡ nào vậy?{How much does this guy eat?}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:07.08,0:34:07.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Akane!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:12.28,0:34:13.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Chuyện gì?{What is it?}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:13.92,0:34:16.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Chắc cậu giận lắm hả?{I guess you're mad, right?}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:17.09,0:34:19.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Tớ không giận mới là vấn đề đấy nhỉ?{It would be strange if I weren't mad, right?}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:21.72,0:34:25.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Như tớ nói hôm qua thì tất cả thực sự chỉ là tình cờ thôi.{Like I said last night,\Nit really was just a coincidence}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:25.43,0:34:28.94,Default,,0,0,0,1,Khi chuẩn bị đi thương lượng thì tớ mới gặp cậu ấy.{that I found him as I was about\Nto make an offer to Mr. Nitobe.}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:29.35,0:34:32.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Nhưng nếu không giải quyết hết mọi chuyện một lần,{But if things haven't been brought to a head,}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:33.02,0:34:36.11,Default,,0,0,0,,cậu sẽ mãi bị cầm chân bởi Shinnosuke đấy.{you would've always\Nbeen tied down by Shinnosuke.}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:36.27,0:34:37.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Cậu thôi đi.{That's enough.}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:39.32,0:34:41.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Cậu lo cho việc tự quyết của tớ đến vậy à?{Do you doubt my autonomy that much?}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:42.24,0:34:44.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Tớ cũng chỉ là con người thôi.{I'm a human being, too, you know.}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:44.56,0:34:48.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Cuộc sống của tớ đến bây giờ đều là do tớ tự mình quyết định lấy.{Even the life I've lived has always been chosen\Nwith my decisions alone.}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:50.04,0:34:53.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Chứ chưa bao giờ bị ảnh hưởng bởi một ai cả.{I've never been influenced by anyone.}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:57.72,0:35:00.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Bạn trai cậu có đi làm không?{Does your boyfriend work, Aioi?}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:01.18,0:35:02.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Ảnh có bạn là sinh viên không?{Does he have any friends who are students?}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:02.85,0:35:05.04,Top dialog,,0,0,0,,Ý tớ là quen người đi làm cũng được,{I mean, I like the idea of a working adult,\Nbut I really want to go to a university cafeteria with a college boyfriend at least once.}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:05.04,0:35:10.10,Top dialog,,0,0,0,,nhưng tớ cũng rất muốn được được bạn trai dẫn vào nhà ăn trường đại học một lần.{I mean, I like the idea of a working adult,\Nbut I really want to go to a university cafeteria with a college boyfriend at least once.}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:03.86,0:35:06.06,Default,,0,0,0,1,Dù mình không nói gì,{I can't get through to her,\Nbut she's positive to a fault}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:06.06,0:35:08.73,Default,,0,0,0,1,mà cậu ta vẫn hăng hái thật đấy.{I can't get through to her,\Nbut she's positive to a fault}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:10.19,0:35:12.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Cứ như là Michinko vậy.{She reminds me of Michinko.}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:14.52,0:35:15.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Tới rồi.{Is he here?}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:17.53,0:35:18.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Bạn em đây hả?{Is that your friend? Hello!}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:18.92,0:35:20.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Xin chào.{Is that your friend? Hello!}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:21.66,0:35:22.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Xin chào.{Oh, h-hello.}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:24.16,0:35:24.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Thấy không?{See? Not a man.}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:24.89,0:35:26.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Có anh nào đâu.{See? Not a man.}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:27.70,0:35:28.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Sao?{What?}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:28.71,0:35:30.04,Default,,0,0,0,1,Vô viện vì con nai?{Downed by a deer?}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:32.00,0:35:33.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Nai?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:33.84,0:35:34.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Vâng.{Yes. The bassist, Mr. Ito, and the drummer,\NMr. Kodama, got food poisoning.}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:34.62,0:35:38.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Anh Ito chơi bass và tay trống Kodama bị ngộ độc thực phẩm.{Yes. The bassist, Mr. Ito, and the drummer,\NMr. Kodama, got food poisoning.}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:39.76,0:35:41.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Đúng là siêu ngon.{It was super delicious.}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:41.59,0:35:42.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Tôi không hối hận đâu.{I have no regrets.}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:42.84,0:35:44.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Hai anh nên hối hận đi!{You should!}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:44.22,0:35:46.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Đã bảo phải nấu chín cơ mà!{You were told to cook it thoroughly!}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:46.18,0:35:48.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Nhưng nếu đợi thì gã này ăn mất.{If I'd waited, this guy would've eaten it!}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:48.16,0:35:49.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Nói mi mới đúng.{That's you!}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:49.79,0:35:51.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Coi kìa!{Wow, they're like real rock musicians!}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:51.01,0:35:52.78,Default,,0,0,0,1,Những nghệ sĩ thực thụ!{Wow, they're like real rock musicians!}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:49.85,0:35:50.74,Top dialog,,0,0,0,,Nói tóm lại,{Anyway, you'll both have to fast for a week,\Nuntil the inflammation subsides.}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:50.74,0:35:53.82,Top dialog,,0,0,0,,hai anh sẽ không được ăn gì hết cho tới khi khá hơn.{Anyway, you'll both have to fast for a week,\Nuntil the inflammation subsides.}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:54.61,0:35:56.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Tình hình căng thật đấy.{Would they be able to make the performance?本番は厳しいですかね}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:56.94,0:35:59.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Thôi thì ít nhất ta cũng có máy thu âm.{But you'll get plenty of nutrients\Nthrough an IV drip.Well, at least we have a sound generator}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:59.64,0:36:02.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Tệ nhất thì không tổ chức biểu diễn nữa.{Well, at least we have a sound generator, so in\Na worst-case scenario, it doesn't have to be live.}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:02.12,0:36:05.49,Top dialog,lyric,0,0,0,,Không được đâu, bạn tôi ơi.{I'm afraid not, my friend. I'm afraid not.}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:05.58,0:36:07.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Thầy Nitobe.{Mr. Nitobe?}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:07.24,0:36:08.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Âm thanh là một thực thể sống,{Sound is a living thing.}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:09.04,0:36:10.28,Default,,0,0,0,,một dạng của sự sống.{It's a form of life.}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:10.33,0:36:14.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Âm thanh không sống thì khó mà thể hiện tiếng lòng của enka được. {If the sound isn't live,\NI cannot sing the heart of enka.}  {If the sound isn't live,\NI cannot sing the heart of enka.Enka là một thể loại âm nhạc đại chúng của Nhật Bản, được hình thành trong thời đại Meiji - (演/En - trình diễn, 歌/ka - ca khúc)}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:14.04,0:36:18.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Một điều mà Nitobe Dankichi này không bao giờ làm đó là...{The one thing Dankichi Nitobe never does\Nis sing to recorded music.}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:18.00,0:36:19.51,Default,,0,0,0,,hát bằng nhạc thu âm.{The one thing Dankichi Nitobe never does\Nis sing to recorded music.}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:19.64,0:36:20.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Nhưng mà...{B-But...}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:20.94,0:36:24.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Tìm đâu ra người thay thế trong thời gian ngắn như vậy.{Trying to find people who can\Ntake their places on such short notice...}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:26.43,0:36:29.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Mọi người cần một tay trống và bass phải không?{You need a drummer and a bassist, right?}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:30.28,0:36:30.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Đúng vậy.{Yeah, that's right.}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:30.83,0:36:32.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Ta có rồi mà!{We've got them!}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:32.19,0:36:33.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Tay trống này.{A drummer...}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:33.27,0:36:34.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Tay bass này.{...and a bassist.}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:38.36,0:36:40.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Nghiêm túc đấy à?{Are you serious?}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:40.21,0:36:43.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Một nữ sinh và một nhân viên văn phòng sẽ chơi thay à?{The stands-ins are a high school girl\Nand an employee of City Hall?}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:43.53,0:36:44.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Thú vị đấy.{It sounds like fun.}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:44.78,0:36:45.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Không được đâu.{It won't work.}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:45.95,0:36:46.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Nhưng...{But Mr. Nitobe loves the idea.}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:46.89,0:36:48.95,Default,,0,0,0,,thầy Nitobe rất thích ý tưởng này.{But Mr. Nitobe loves the idea.}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:49.04,0:36:51.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Hiện ông ấy đang giải thích ở tòa thị chính.{He's at City Hall right now, explaining it.}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:52.30,0:36:55.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Sao sự việc lại ra nông nỗi này?{Mr. Nitobe went there himself?\NWhy is this happening?}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:53.92,0:36:55.58,Default,,0,0,0,,{Why is this happening?}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:55.71,0:36:58.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Tôi không muốn chơi cùng trẻ con.{I don't want to be part of a brat's playtime.}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:58.55,0:37:00.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Tôi là dân chơi chuyên nghiệp.{I'm a professional.}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:02.05,0:37:04.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Thế mà bảo em là "Mắt sao" cơ đấy.{Even though you told me I was an eyeball star.}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:07.39,0:37:09.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Sao anh không thử quan sát, {Why don't you watch me\Nand then decide whether it's "playtime"?}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:09.29,0:37:10.51,Default,,0,0,0,,rồi tự quyết định xem?{Why don't you watch me\Nand then decide whether it's "playtime"?}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:10.51,0:37:12.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Này Aoi.{Hey, Aoi.}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:12.48,0:37:15.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Good idea!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:16.06,0:37:18.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Cho tôi xem hai người có gì nào?{By all means, show us what you've got.}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:38.79,0:37:39.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Michinko.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:08.04,0:38:09.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Khá đấy chứ!{But it's a far away world\NOh, they're actually good.}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:09.97,0:38:10.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Cũng không tệ.{But it's a far away world}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:10.88,0:38:13.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Nhưng tại sao lại là Gandhara.{Yeah, I'm impressed. But why "Gandhara"?}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:16.65,0:38:18.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Ngầu quá!{Wow, so cool!}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:26.17,0:38:27.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Tuyệt vời!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:27.65,0:38:29.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Có thể thấy được nhiệt huyết của họ.{I feel love in their performance.}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:30.02,0:38:33.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Đây sẽ là điểm nhấn của lễ hội.{This will be the highlight of the festival.}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:50.71,0:38:52.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Tuyệt vời!{Awesome!}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:52.11,0:38:53.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Em tuyệt thật đấy, Ao!{That's awesome, Ao!}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:54.14,0:38:57.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Tuổi này đã biểu diễn trong ban nhạc chuyên nghiệp rồi.{At your age, performing as a member\Nof a professional backup band?}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:57.54,0:39:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,1,Chỉ là may mắn thôi.{Well, it just kind of worked out that way.}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:00.08,0:39:01.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Vậy thì tốt quá rồi.{Isn't that what you want?}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:01.58,0:39:07.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Chị Aoi sẽ tạo cơ hội để chị Akane bắt chuyện với anh ở hiện tại.{If you're near the real one, that gives\NAkane more chances to talk to the real one, too.}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:08.00,0:39:11.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Như vậy là có thể đưa hai người xích lại gần nhau rồi.{Yeah, the chance to get\Nthose two together would be there!}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:11.26,0:39:12.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Nhưng mà...{But...}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:12.68,0:39:14.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Liệu chị có làm được không?{will I really be able to do it?}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:15.68,0:39:17.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Biểu diễn cùng dân chuyên ấy.{Performing with professionals...}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:18.02,0:39:19.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Dĩ nhiên là được.{You can do it.}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:19.57,0:39:21.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Em cũng như anh.{Just like me, you're an eyeball star.}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:21.51,0:39:23.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Là "Mắt sao" cơ mà.{Just like me, you're an eyeball star.}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:28.00,0:39:30.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Giờ thì tập thôi...Em mang tập nhạc không?.{All right, let's practice.\NYou brought the score, right?}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:34.37,0:39:35.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Aoi?{Aoi, are you in here?}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:35.53,0:39:36.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Có đó không?{Aoi, are you in here?}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:40.71,0:39:41.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Sao vậy?{What's wrong?}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:42.20,0:39:43.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Không có gì.{N-Nothing.}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:43.63,0:39:45.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Có chuyện gì sao, chị Akane?{Is anything wrong for you, Akane?}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:47.55,0:39:48.88,Default,,0,0,0,,À.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:48.88,0:39:49.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Xin lỗi nhé.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:50.05,0:39:51.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Vì đã kéo em vô vụ này.{Getting you mixed up in this.}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:53.37,0:39:57.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Chị cứ nghĩ đến việc em được đứng trên sân khấu nên...{When I imagined you standing on a big stage,\NI couldn't help it.}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:58.77,0:40:00.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Không sao đâu.{Oh, I... don't mind.}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:01.10,0:40:02.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Thật ra...{Well, I'm kind of looking forward to it.}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:02.35,0:40:03.44,Default,,0,0,0,,em cũng...{Well, I'm kind of looking forward to it.}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:03.53,0:40:05.27,Default,,0,0,0,,mong chờ chuyện đó lắm.{Well, I'm kind of looking forward to it.}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:07.07,0:40:07.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Vậy sao?{I see.}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:07.95,0:40:09.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Đây là ít đồ ngọt.{Oh, here re some sweets. For you too, Tsugu.}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:09.48,0:40:10.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Tsugu ăn luôn nhé.{Oh, here re some sweets. For you too, Tsugu.}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:12.06,0:40:14.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Hai đứa đừng ở lại lâu quá nhé.{Well, don't stay up too late.}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:17.82,0:40:19.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Em nghĩ chị ấy không nghi ngờ gì đâu.{I don't think she suspected anything.}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:23.35,0:40:24.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Làm giật mình.{You scared me!}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:25.96,0:40:27.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Cậu ấy đã trở thành một bà cô rồi.{She's become an old woman.}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:28.09,0:40:29.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Đúng vậy.{Well...}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:31.22,0:40:33.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Một bà cô cực kì dễ thương.{An incredibly cute old woman.}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:34.80,0:40:40.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Một bà cô xinh xắn và dễ thương hơn bất kì một người mẫu hay idol nào. {An old woman cuter and more beautiful\Nthan any model or pinup idol.}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:44.33,0:40:45.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Anh không sao chứ?{Um... Are you okay?}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:46.37,0:40:47.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Ý em là sao?{What do you mean?}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:48.98,0:40:51.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Akane mấy năm qua chắc phải khó khăn lắm.{Akane must have had a hard time\Nall these years.}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:52.91,0:40:55.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Với anh thì chỉ mới như hôm qua.{For me, it happened yesterday,\Nbut Akane's been alone all this time.}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:55.68,0:40:58.15,Default,,0,0,0,,còn Akane lúc nào cũng một mình như vậy.{For me, it happened yesterday,\Nbut Akane's been alone all this time.}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:58.49,0:41:01.83,Default,,0,0,0,1,Anh muốn cậu ấy sớm có được hạnh phúc của riêng mình.{I want Akane to become happy\Nas fast as possible.}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:02.77,0:41:04.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Shinno...
Dialogue: 0,0:41:05.37,0:41:06.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Nhưng mà,{Still, I bet now that "m an old man,\NI've gotten really good with the guitar.}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:06.57,0:41:10.51,Default,,0,0,0,,anh giờ chắc cũng là một ông chú chơi guitar đỉnh lắm hả?{Still, I bet now that "m an old man,\NI've gotten really good with the guitar.}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:10.84,0:41:12.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Đúng vậy.{Well, yeah.}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:12.80,0:41:13.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Thật không?{Really?}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:14.01,0:41:16.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Muốn em ghi hình lại không?{Want me to record it for you? You playing.}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:17.15,0:41:18.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Dùng cái này.{With this.}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:18.22,0:41:19.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Làm được luôn hả?{You can do that?}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:20.01,0:41:21.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Smartphone lợi hại thật.{Man, smartphones these days!}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:21.56,0:41:23.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Game lúc nãy chơi cũng đỉnh lắm.{That game was incredible, too.\NLet me borrow that for the night.}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:23.62,0:41:25.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Anh mượn một đêm được không?{That game was incredible, too.\NLet me borrow that for the night.}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:25.48,0:41:26.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Không được.{Forget about it.}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:26.53,0:41:28.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Vậy mượn của em không?{Want to borrow mine?}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:28.53,0:41:29.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Được không?{It's okay?}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:29.27,0:41:31.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Nếu chỉ một đêm thì không sao.{I don't mind if it's just one night.}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:31.62,0:41:34.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Chỉ có chị Akane và Tsugu gọi cho em thôi.{Besides, the only people who call me\Nare Akane and Tsugu.}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:35.13,0:41:36.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Mật khẩu là...{Um, the password is--}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:36.08,0:41:37.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Đó là thông tin cá nhân mà!{Hey! That's personal information!}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:37.55,0:41:38.87,Top dialog,,0,0,0,,Thank you, Ao!
Dialogue: 0,0:41:38.95,0:41:41.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Chị em nuôi dạy em tốt thật đấy!{Your sister really raised you right!}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:41.20,0:41:43.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Đừng có tự tiện sờ đầu em.{Hey! Don't touch my head so easily!}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:47.38,0:41:48.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Này.{Hey.}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:50.38,0:41:52.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Em sẽ ghi hình thật à?{Are you really going to record it?}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:52.71,0:41:53.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Sao vậy?{Why?}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:54.88,0:41:56.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Nếu thấy bản thân hiện giờ,{If he sees his present self,\Nhe might get disappointed.}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:56.44,0:41:58.13,Default,,0,0,0,,chắc anh ấy thất vọng lắm.{If he sees his present self,\Nhe might get disappointed.}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:59.05,0:41:59.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Vậy sao?{-I don't know.\N- I do!}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:59.88,0:42:01.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Chứ sao?{-I don't know.\N- I do!}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:01.22,0:42:03.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Shinno có thể hơi ngốc nghếch,{Shinno may be a dummy,}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:03.22,0:42:04.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Nhưng anh ấy tốt bụng,{but he's somewhat kind and would never\Nmake fun of someone! And also...}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:04.62,0:42:06.40,Default,,0,0,0,,không bao giờ cười nhạo ai,{but he's somewhat kind and would never\Nmake fun of someone! And also...}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:06.40,0:42:07.08,Default,,0,0,0,,với lại...{but he's somewhat kind and would never\Nmake fun of someone! And also...}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:11.08,0:42:11.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Gì thế?{What?}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:12.80,0:42:14.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Không có gì.{Nothing}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:21.78,0:42:22.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Vậy...{So what are you doing here?}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:23.28,0:42:24.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Cậu ở đây làm gì?{So what are you doing here?}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:25.02,0:42:27.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Cậu sẽ quay anh Shinnosuke đúng không?{You're going to record Shinnosuke, right?}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:27.20,0:42:29.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Để tớ lo cho, tớ giỏi chuyện ấy lắm.{You can leave that to me! I'm good at it!}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:29.46,0:42:31.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Tớ còn có thể làm mấy việc vặt nữa.{I can also do odd jobs. Like a manager?}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:31.44,0:42:32.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Quản lý chẳng hạn.{I can also do odd jobs. Like a manager?}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:32.75,0:42:35.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Lúc em tới thì chị ấy đã ở đây rồi.{She was already here when I arrived.}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:36.08,0:42:36.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Mà...{Well, it's good to have more resources, right?}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:36.82,0:42:38.91,Default,,0,0,0,,có thêm nhân lực cũng tốt chứ sao?{Well, it's good to have more resources, right?}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:38.91,0:42:41.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Em thật hiểu chuyện đấy nhóc.{You really understand, huh, little guy.}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:41.43,0:42:42.64,Default,,0,0,0,,A đây rồi.{here you are.}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:43.11,0:42:45.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Buổi tập sắp bắt đầu rồi đấy.{Rehearsal is about to start,\Nso please get ready.}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:45.35,0:42:47.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Vô chuẩn bị đi em.{Rehearsal is about to start,\Nso please get ready.}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:47.10,0:42:47.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Vâng.{Okay.}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:58.93,0:43:00.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Mọi người làm tốt lắm.{All right, great job!}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:00.95,0:43:03.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Anh Shinnosuke ngầu thật đấy!{- Shinnosuke is so cool!\N-I'll do an equipment check, so please stand by!}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:01.55,0:43:04.37,Top dialog,,0,0,0,,Tôi sẽ đi kiểm tra dụng cụ nên xin chờ một lát!{- Shinnosuke is so cool!\N-I'll do an equipment check, so please stand by!}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:06.24,0:43:07.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Cái gì vậy?{What is this?}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:09.62,0:43:12.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Em đang đùa đấy hả, Aoi?{Is this your idea of a joke, Aoi?}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:14.13,0:43:15.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Em là tay bass cơ mà.{You're playing bass, right?}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:15.63,0:43:17.88,Default,,0,0,0,1,Sao lại cố chơi trội hơn vậy?{So why are you trying to stand out?}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:21.51,0:43:22.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Em...{S-Sorry.}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:22.73,0:43:23.89,Default,,0,0,0,,xin lỗi.{S-Sorry.}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:23.97,0:43:24.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Thật là.{Sheesh.}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:24.85,0:43:26.53,Default,,0,0,0,1,Chơi bass vốn dĩ..{Women aren't fit to play bass in the first place.}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:26.53,0:43:28.89,Default,,0,0,0,1,không dành cho con gái ngay từ đầu rồi.{Women aren't fit to play bass in the first place.}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:29.48,0:43:30.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Vậy Aoi này,{All right, Ao! When you get bigger,\Nyou'll play bass in our band.}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:30.60,0:43:33.80,Default,,0,0,0,,khi nào lớn lên hãy tham gia band của bọn anh nhé.{All right, Ao! When you get bigger,\Nyou'll play bass in our band.}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:34.75,0:43:36.87,Top dialog,,0,0,0,,Anh đã nói tôi vậy kia mà.{You're the one who told me that!.}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:33.82,0:43:36.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Tay và cơ thể em lại nhỏ, nên cũng không giữ nhịp được.{Your hands and body are small,\Nso you can't maintain the rhythm.}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:36.87,0:43:40.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Rồi rồi, dù gì bọn tớ cũng chỉ là nghiệp dư thôi mà.{Okay, okay! But we're amateurs and this\Nis our first time, so there's going to be...}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:40.00,0:43:41.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Đây lại là lần đầu nên...{Okay, okay! But we're amateurs and this\Nis our first time, so there's going to be...}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:41.53,0:43:45.74,Top dialog,,0,0,0,,Việc những tay nghiệp dư biểu diễn cùng dân chuyên mới là vấn đề thực sự.{Amateurs trying to stand with the professionals\Nare the real problems here.}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:46.72,0:43:48.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Cả cậu nữa, Michinko.{And you, Michinko.}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:48.54,0:43:51.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Cậu đánh theo bass làm cả đám loạn hết cả lên.{You're following the bass,\Nand that messes the rest of us up.}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:52.63,0:43:56.09,Default,,0,0,0,1,Tay trống không giữ được nhịp thì có ở đây cũng vô ích.{If the drummer can't keep the rhythm,\Nhe's got no business being here.}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:56.21,0:43:57.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Anh Shin ơi!{Shin!}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:57.27,0:43:58.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Anh có đó không?{There you are!}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:59.01,0:44:00.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Rộng thật đấy.{- This place is so big!\N- Hi, Eiko!}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:59.47,0:44:01.13,Top dialog,,0,0,0,,Ồ, là Eiko.{- This place is so big!\N- Hi, Eiko!}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:01.22,0:44:02.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Hi!{- Hi!\N- We're here, Shin!}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:02.02,0:44:03.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Bọn em tới rồi nè, anh Shin.{- Hi!\N- We're here, Shin!}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:05.02,0:44:06.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Làm sao mà...{Why?}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:06.01,0:44:07.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Hình như họ đến đón cậu đấy.{It seems they've come to pick you up.}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:07.93,0:44:10.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Thầy Nitobe đang trên đường đến đây.{Mr. Nitobe is already on his way.}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:10.85,0:44:12.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Đúng là...{Professionals really do things differently.}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:12.47,0:44:14.48,Default,,0,0,0,,dân chuyên có khác.{Professionals really do things differently.}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:14.56,0:44:15.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Nhưng...{Uh, well...}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:15.05,0:44:16.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Anh Shin,{Come on, Shin. Let's go!}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:16.55,0:44:17.60,Default,,0,0,0,,ta đi thôi.{Come on, Shin. Let's go!}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:17.60,0:44:20.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Khi say anh Shin cáu kỉnh thật đấy.{You're a real grouch\Nwhen you're drunk, Shinnosuke.}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:21.30,0:44:23.45,Default,,0,0,0,1,Thì ra anh ấy thuộc kiểu hoang dại.{- Come on, Dan is waiting.\N- Wow, he's the wild type.}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:23.77,0:44:25.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Hôm nay chắc xong rồi đấy.{That's all for today, I guess.}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:27.80,0:44:29.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Chị làm gì thế?{What are you doing?}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:29.50,0:44:33.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Gửi đoạn video cho Aioi.{I sent the recording to Aioi's phone.}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:37.00,0:44:39.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Cái...{Y-You... rotten old man!}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:39.35,0:44:41.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Cái tên khốn này.{Y-You... rotten old man!}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:41.26,0:44:42.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Thấy mất rồi.{He saw it.}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:42.51,0:44:45.34,Default,,0,0,0,1,Gã khó ở này bị gì vậy?{What the hell is wrong\Nwith this seedy old man?}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:45.43,0:44:47.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Còn đến cả Cabaret Club nữa?{And he's going to a hostess bar?}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:47.77,0:44:50.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Cứ đà này thì không thể để gã có được Akane .{I can't let him have Akane at this rate.}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:50.20,0:44:54.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Mình cần phải siêu thoát trước khi hai bọn họ đến với nhau.{I have to rehabilitate him\Nbefore getting them together.}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:55.98,0:44:57.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Nhưng mà...{But still...}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:00.77,0:45:02.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Anh đã thực sự...{I really did become a professional, huh?}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:02.52,0:45:04.24,Default,,0,0,0,,thành dân chuyên rồi nhỉ?{I really did become a professional, huh?}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:05.36,0:45:07.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Gã khốn đó...{Damn it, that bastard...}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:08.37,0:45:11.29,Default,,0,0,0,1,đến rốn còn lồi mà cứ làm như ngầu lắm.{Acting like he's too cool,\Nwhen he's even got an outie.}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:11.37,0:45:12.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Rốn lồi?{An outie?}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:12.37,0:45:13.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Ừm.{Yeah. Here, want to see?}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:13.17,0:45:13.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Đây này.{Yeah. Here, want to see?}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:13.97,0:45:14.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Muốn xem không.{Yeah. Here, want to see?}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:14.83,0:45:16.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Không cần.{No need.}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:16.21,0:45:17.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Xem nào,{Well, since it's come to this, it's your turn, Ao.}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:17.00,0:45:18.35,Default,,0,0,0,,nếu đã đến mức này,{Well, since it's come to this, it's your turn, Ao.}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:18.35,0:45:20.22,Default,,0,0,0,,đến lượt em xuất chiêu đấy.{Well, since it's come to this, it's your turn, Ao.}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:20.30,0:45:25.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Làm một buổi trình diễn thật xuất sắc để đập tan sự tự cao của hắn.{Do a brilliant performance\Nthat will crush his pride to smithereens.}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:26.76,0:45:27.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Liệu...{Will...}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:29.22,0:45:31.06,Default,,0,0,0,,em có làm được không?{Will I he able to do that?}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:31.14,0:45:33.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Chuyện đó thì dĩ nhiên rồi.{Of course you can do it!}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:33.23,0:45:35.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Nhất định em sẽ làm được.{If it's you, you can definitely do it.}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:35.73,0:45:36.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Phải không?{Right, eyeball star?}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:36.65,0:45:37.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Mắt sao.{Right, eyeball star?}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:42.90,0:45:43.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Tốt.{All right! Then let's get practicing.}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:43.57,0:45:45.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Giờ thì luyện tập thôi.{All right! Then let's get practicing.}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:45.66,0:45:46.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Em có metronome không?{Do you have a metronome?}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:46.91,0:45:49.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Trên điện thoại có phần mềm đấy.{I have an app. It's on that phone.}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:49.91,0:45:51.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Lại Smartphone à?{Smartphone again? This really is amazing.}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:51.62,0:45:52.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Lợi hại thật.{Smartphone again? This really is amazing.}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:55.58,0:45:58.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Nếu như anh Shinno...{If "Shinno" returned to that "Shinnosuke,”}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:58.01,0:46:00.23,Default,,0,0,0,,quay về lại với Shinnosuke kia,{If "Shinno" returned to that "Shinnosuke,”}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:00.75,0:46:02.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Thì Anh Shinno sẽ ra sao nhỉ?{what would happen to this "Shinno'?}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:02.84,0:46:04.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Khi chơi bass,{With a bass, no matter how sloppy things get,}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:04.39,0:46:06.72,Default,,0,0,0,,dù có lộn xộn thế nào đi nữa,{With a bass, no matter how sloppy things get,}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:06.80,0:46:09.04,Default,,0,0,0,,cũng phải đánh nhịp thật chính xác...{you have to beat out the rhythm correctly\Nand support everyone.}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:09.04,0:46:11.20,Default,,0,0,0,,để hỗ trợ cho mọi người.{you have to beat out the rhythm correctly\Nand support everyone.}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:11.99,0:46:14.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Trong lúc nghe những âm thanh khác,{While listening to everyone else's sound,\Nyou need to keep your own pace.}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:14.08,0:46:15.81,Default,,0,0,0,,em cần giữ được nhịp của mình.{While listening to everyone else's sound,\Nyou need to keep your own pace.}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:24.98,0:46:27.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Anh Shinnosuke không ở đây sao?{Shinnosuke isn't here?}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:27.32,0:46:28.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Tại sao?{Why? The performance\Nis right around the corner!}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:28.42,0:46:30.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Gần tới buổi diễn rồi mà.{Why? The performance\Nis right around the corner!}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:30.32,0:46:33.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Dù gì hôm nay chúng ta cũng không có lịch tập nào.{Well, we didn't have a rehearsal\Nscheduled for today anyway.}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:33.86,0:46:35.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Hơn nữa,{Besides, he said practicing together\Nwith amateurs will dull his own skill.}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:35.13,0:46:39.00,Default,,0,0,0,,cậu ta bảo tập cùng nghiệp dư làm mai một kĩ năng của cậu ấy.{Besides, he said practicing together\Nwith amateurs will dull his own skill.}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:41.22,0:46:42.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Thật quá đáng!{That jerk!}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:43.34,0:46:45.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Đừng có xem thường người khác thế chứ.{I'm sick of him belittling us!}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:46.17,0:46:48.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Sao anh ta lại thành ra như vậy nhỉ?{He's completely different from Shinno.\NWhat happened to make him like this?}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:48.45,0:46:49.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Chả giống Shinno chút nào.{He's completely different from Shinno.\NWhat happened to make him like this?}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:50.01,0:46:50.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Shinno?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:51.01,0:46:51.98,Default,,0,0,0,,À.{Yeah, that's what we used to call Shinnosuke.}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:51.98,0:46:54.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Bọn anh hay gọi Shinnosuke là Shinno.{Yeah, that's what we used to call Shinnosuke.}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:54.97,0:46:56.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Không phải.{Wrong! Shinno isn't Shinnosuke at all!}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:56.16,0:46:58.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Shinno không phải là Shinnosuke.{Wrong! Shinno isn't Shinnosuke at all!}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:00.96,0:47:02.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Anh Nakamura.{Mr. Nakamura!}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:02.86,0:47:04.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Cửa mở rồi này.{I opened it for you.}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:05.81,0:47:07.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Đi tập thôi Aoi.{Thanks! Come on, Aoi. Let's practice.}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:08.03,0:47:11.87,Default,,0,0,0,1,Nếu ta không giữ được nhịp thì có nói gì cũng vô ích thôi.{If us, the rhythm group, doesn't have\Nthe rhythm locked down, there's no point.}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:12.30,0:47:13.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Em biết rồi!{I know!}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:15.65,0:47:18.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Shinno và Shinnosuke à?{Shinno and Shinnosuke, huh?}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:18.37,0:47:19.85,Default,,0,0,0,1,Chả cần biết ai là ai.{It didn't matter which one,\Nbut if he's not here, I'm going home.}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:20.29,0:47:22.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Anh ấy không có đây thì mình về thôi.{It didn't matter which one,\Nbut if he's not here, I'm going home.}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:26.63,0:47:28.80,Top dialog,,0,0,0,,Tay guitar solo ấy giỏi thật nhỉ?{That guitar solo was great.}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:28.88,0:47:30.05,Top dialog,,0,0,0,,Đúng đấy.{I know, right?}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:30.22,0:47:31.11,Top dialog,,0,0,0,,Cậu chơi được không?{Can you do it?}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:31.11,0:47:32.24,Top dialog,,0,0,0,,Tớ chưa đủ trình đâu.{Nah, that's beyond me.}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:57.46,0:47:59.04,Default,,0,0,0,1,Tìm thấy anh rồi!{I found you!}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:09.42,0:48:10.59,Default,,0,0,0,,{All right.}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:12.00,0:48:12.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Một lần nữa.{One more time.}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:12.88,0:48:13.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Này.{Hey, you okay?}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:13.45,0:48:14.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Em không sao chứ?{Hey, you okay?}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:14.97,0:48:17.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Em chơi cũng lâu rồi đấy.{You've been playing for a while now.}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:17.24,0:48:18.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Trước khi đến đây,{And you were practicing with Michinko\Nbefore coming here, right?}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:18.78,0:48:20.71,Default,,0,0,0,,em đã tập với Michinko rồi mà.{And you were practicing with Michinko\Nbefore coming here, right?}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:20.71,0:48:21.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Không sao.{I'm fine.}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:22.16,0:48:24.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Hơn nữa, gần 9h rồi đấy.{It's almost 9:00 p.m., right?}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:24.28,0:48:27.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Những lúc thế này thì Michinko sẽ bỏ qua thôi.{At a time like this, Michinko will allow it.}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:27.67,0:48:29.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Em không học bài à?{You don't need to study?}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:29.13,0:48:30.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Không sao đâu mà.{Don't worry about it.}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:30.97,0:48:33.24,Default,,0,0,0,1,Em đâu có định thi vào đại học.{It's not like i'm going to go to college.}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:33.32,0:48:34.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Vậy à,{I see. So what are you going to do?}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:34.39,0:48:35.26,Default,,0,0,0,,em sẽ làm gì.{I see. So what are you going to do?}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:38.22,0:48:40.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Lên Tokyo và vào một ban nhạc.{Go to Tokyo and be in a band.}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:41.56,0:48:44.54,Default,,0,0,0,1,Có người đi theo con đường của anh luôn này.{Someone who'll follow in my footsteps\Nand they're right here!}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:44.97,0:48:47.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Đừng khen em thẳng thừng vậy.{Don't praise me so straightforwardly like that.そんな まつすぐに褒めないで}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:48.34,0:48:51.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Động cơ của em không có chính đáng đâu.{I'm not doing it for a logical reason.}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:51.59,0:48:52.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Không chính đáng?{You're not?}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:53.57,0:48:56.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Em muốn rời khỏi thị trấn này.{I want to leave this town...私が地元を出たいのは}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:58.27,0:48:59.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Để chị Akane có thể ...{so Akane can live however way she wants to.}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:59.55,0:49:01.56,Default,,0,0,0,,có cuộc sống của riêng mình.{so Akane can live however way she wants to.}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:02.52,0:49:04.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Chỉ vì em...{Because of me,\NI'm sure she's had to hold back}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:04.09,0:49:05.90,Default,,0,0,0,,mà chị Akane đã...{Because of me,\NI'm sure she's had to hold back}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:06.69,0:49:09.90,Default,,0,0,0,1,không thể làm những thứ mà chị ấy muốn.{from doing all kinds of things\Nshe's been wanting to do.}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:11.60,0:49:13.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Nếu em còn ở đây,{If I stay here,\NAkane will be chained to this place forever.}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:13.87,0:49:17.07,Default,,0,0,0,,chị Akane sẽ mãi bị giam cầm ở nơi này mất.{If I stay here,\NAkane will be chained to this place forever.}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:18.53,0:49:19.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Hơn nữa,{Besides, there isn't anything\NI want to do especially,}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:19.87,0:49:22.32,Default,,0,0,0,1,cũng chả có gì đặc biệt mà em muốn làm.{Besides, there isn't anything\NI want to do especially,}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:23.04,0:49:25.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Em không muốn là gánh nặng cho chị ấy nữa.{so I don't want her to waste money on me.}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:26.17,0:49:27.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Em không muốn vì em,{I don't want to be a burden on her any more.}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:27.67,0:49:29.92,Default,,0,0,0,,mà chị ấy phải lãng phí tiền bạc nữa.{I don't want to be a burden on her any more.}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:30.84,0:49:33.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Đừng tự trách mình thế.{You're blaming yourself too much.}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:33.39,0:49:35.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Không ai nghĩ đó là lỗi của em cả.{- Nobody thinks it's your fault--\N- Everyone is thinking that.}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:34.92,0:49:36.78,Top dialog,,0,0,0,,Mọi người ai cũng nghĩ như vậy.{.- Nobody thinks it's your fault--\N- Everyone is thinking that.}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:37.44,0:49:39.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Từ họ hàng cho đến mấy cô hàng xóm.{The neighborhood housewives\Nand our relatives, too.}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:41.31,0:49:42.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Ao...
Dialogue: 0,0:49:43.58,0:49:44.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Đó là sự thật.{It's the truth.}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:45.53,0:49:46.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Cho nên,{That's why I'm leaving.}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:46.54,0:49:48.19,Default,,0,0,0,,em sẽ rời khỏi đây.{That's why I'm leaving.}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:49.27,0:49:51.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Em giỏi thật đấy.{You're incredible.}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:53.32,0:49:54.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Em biết không,{You know...}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:56.44,0:50:00.37,Default,,0,0,0,,anh đã suy nghĩ về việc tại sao mình lại ở đây.{I've been thinking about why I'm here.}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:01.18,0:50:02.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Linh hồn sống à?{A living spirit?生霊}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:04.50,0:50:07.88,Default,,0,0,0,1,Anh không nghĩ nó là do những cảm xúc trước kia đâu.{I don't think it's because of\Nany lingering attachments.}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:08.29,0:50:09.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Mà thực ra,{But the truth is that some part of me\Nmight be afraid to leave this town.}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:09.82,0:50:11.48,Default,,0,0,0,,đấy có thể là do,{But the truth is that some part of me\Nmight be afraid to leave this town.}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:11.48,0:50:16.05,Default,,0,0,0,,phần nào đấy trong anh có chút lo sợ khi rời khỏi thị trấn này.{But the truth is that some part of me\Nmight be afraid to leave this town.}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:17.01,0:50:18.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Chính vì vậy,{In that respect, you're incredible.}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:18.05,0:50:19.89,Default,,0,0,0,,nên em thực sự dũng cảm đấy.{In that respect, you're incredible.}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:20.40,0:50:21.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Dù vẫn còn đầy hoài nghi,{You're full of doubts,}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:22.81,0:50:26.89,Default,,0,0,0,,nhưng em vẫn cân nhắc và quyết định rời khỏi nơi này.{but you thought it through\Nand made up your mind to leave this place.}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:32.78,0:50:34.69,Default,,0,0,0,1,Trả lại anh vì lần trước.{I got you back for doing that to me.}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:34.78,0:50:36.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Trả đũa anh luôn à?{You got me back?お返しつて  お前}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:36.64,0:50:39.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Là tay bass thì phải hỗ trợ cho mọi người.{The bassist has to support everyone!}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:43.30,0:50:44.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Đúng rồi đấy!{That's right!}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:44.64,0:50:47.08,Default,,0,0,0,1,Đúng là tay bass tương lai của anh.{Now that's my band's future bassist!さすが未来のうちのベ一シスト}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:47.08,0:50:48.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Mà khoan đã,{Wait, what? This is the future?}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:48.31,0:50:49.63,Default,,0,0,0,,giờ là tương lai rồi mà.{Wait, what? This is the future?}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:49.84,0:50:50.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Như vậy là...{Then...}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:50.45,0:50:51.75,Top dialog,,0,0,0,,Anh vẫn còn nhớ sao?{You remembered?}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:52.88,0:50:54.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Nhờ chứ.{Remembered? I promised you.}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:54.73,0:50:56.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Anh đã hứa với em mà.{Remembered? I promised you.}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:56.92,0:50:59.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Chẳng phải đó là lý do em chơi bass sao?{Isn't that why you're playing the bass?}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:06.64,0:51:08.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Làm em nữa.{Do it to me, too.}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:08.85,0:51:09.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Làm gì?{What? Ruffle your hair?}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:09.76,0:51:11.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Sờ đầu hả?{What? Ruffle your hair?}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:11.65,0:51:14.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Búng tay lên trán em ấy.{My forehead. Flick it. Please.}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:16.42,0:51:17.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Được thôi.{Well, if you want.}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:17.49,0:51:18.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Mạnh nhất có thể.{As hard as you can!}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:18.95,0:51:20.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Được.{Okay!}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:29.23,0:51:30.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Hẹn anh ngày mai.{Okay, see you tomorrow!}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:31.34,0:51:32.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Này.{Hey!}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:32.46,0:51:33.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Ao?!
Dialogue: 0,0:51:48.06,0:51:50.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Mình đang làm gì vậy?{What the heck am 1 doing?}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:54.79,0:51:58.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Phải làm cho chị Akane và anh Shinnosuke đến với nhau.{I have to get\NAkane and Shinnosuke together.}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:59.28,0:52:00.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Vì chị Akane,{For Akane's sake...}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:02.16,0:52:03.82,Default,,0,0,0,,và cả Shinno nữa.{and Shinno's sake, too.}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:07.83,0:52:09.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Chào buổi sáng.{- Morning!\N- Good morning.}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:34.26,0:52:35.27,Top dialog,,0,0,0,,Cậu nghe gì chưa.{Listen to this!}
