Dialogue: 0,1:01:18.94,1:01:20.55,Default,,0,0,0,,em muốn nói trước với anh.{I thought I'd tell you first.}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:22.57,1:01:24.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Em...thích chị Ao.{I like Ao.}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:25.41,1:01:26.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Là mối tình đầu.{A first love thing.}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:32.02,1:01:33.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Tại sao anh lại đỏ mặt?{What are you blushing for?}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:34.02,1:01:35.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Anh...{I-I'm not blushing...}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:35.13,1:01:37.23,Default,,0,0,0,,có đỏ mặt đâu.{I-I'm not blushing...}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:38.86,1:01:40.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Nhóc...{You're a precocious runt, aren't you?お前 ずいぶ んおませさんじやねえは}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:40.29,1:01:42.40,Default,,0,0,0,1,đúng là ông cụ non đấy.{You're a precocious runt, aren't you?お前 ずいぶ んおませさんじやねえは}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:43.03,1:01:44.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Giờ thì đúng vậy.{Well, for now I am.まあ 今はね}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:45.36,1:01:46.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Nhưng mà...{But by the time I get a full-time job,}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:46.68,1:01:48.62,Default,,0,0,0,,sau khi có một công việc ổn định,{But by the time I get a full-time job,}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:48.70,1:01:51.27,Default,,0,0,0,,khoảng cách 10 năm về tuổi tác giữa hai đứa...{the less than ten year age gap\Nbetween us won't mean much.}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:51.27,1:01:52.48,Default,,0,0,0,,sẽ được khỏa lấp.{the less than ten year age gap\Nbetween us won't mean much.}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:54.86,1:01:56.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Chắc vậy.{Y-Yeah. True.}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:56.46,1:01:57.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Vì thế...{Since Ao's not great with academics,\NI'll have to pick up the slack there.}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:57.66,1:01:59.71,Default,,0,0,0,,vì chị Ao không giỏi về học thuật,{Since Ao's not great with academics,\NI'll have to pick up the slack there.}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:59.71,1:02:01.86,Default,,0,0,0,,nên em sẽ bù đắp vô khuyết điểm ấy.{Since Ao's not great with academics,\NI'll have to pick up the slack there.}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:01.86,1:02:05.59,Default,,0,0,0,1,Em sẽ trở thành một con người có giá trị.{I intend to become a man of value.}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:06.51,1:02:08.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Vậy sao?{I see.}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:09.43,1:02:11.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Em giỏi thật đấy.{You're amazing.}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:12.85,1:02:14.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Nhưng hiện giờ,{The only thing is, now I've got a rival.}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:14.01,1:02:15.60,Default,,0,0,0,,em đang có tình địch.{The only thing is, now I've got a rival.}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:16.23,1:02:17.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Thật à?{Really?}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:17.23,1:02:18.10,Default,,0,0,0,,{Yeah.}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:22.94,1:02:23.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Thế,{So how do you feel about Ao?}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:23.83,1:02:25.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Anh nghĩ sao về chị Ao?{So how do you feel about Ao?}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:27.12,1:02:27.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Đợi đã.{H-Hey! Wait a second!}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:28.03,1:02:29.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Bình tĩnh đã Tsugu.{Tsugu, think calmly now.}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:29.34,1:02:31.68,Default,,0,0,0,1,Câu đó phải nói anh mới đúng.{That's what I should say to you.}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:35.29,1:02:37.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Anh...{Well, I, uh...}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:37.79,1:02:42.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Trong trí nhớ của anh, Akane đã từ chối anh không thương tiếc.{Look, in my experience,\NAkane just shot me down.}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:42.75,1:02:43.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Lúc đó,{Until then, Aoi was just a little kid.}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:43.66,1:02:45.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Aoi vẫn còn nhỏ lắm.{Until then, Aoi was just a little kid.}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:46.05,1:02:46.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Dù gì thì...{Anyway!}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:48.41,1:02:51.72,Default,,0,0,0,,anh vẫn là linh hồn sống của Shinnosuke mà.{I'm the living spirit of "Shinnosuke,"\Nso in this form...}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:54.40,1:02:56.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Nếu em ấy có thích anh,{Even if she did fall in love with me,\Nit wouldn't amount to anything.}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:56.36,1:02:57.77,Default,,0,0,0,,thì cũng vô ích thôi.{Even if she did fall in love with me,\Nit wouldn't amount to anything.}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:58.80,1:02:59.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Đúng vậy.{Yeah. I agree.}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:01.15,1:03:02.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Vậy nên...{That's why...}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:04.82,1:03:06.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Này, này...{Hey, come on.}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:06.80,1:03:09.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Cậu định tiếp tục bơ tớ đến bao giờ đây?{How long are you going to ignore me?}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:10.43,1:03:12.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Tránh xa tôi ra, đồ trơ trẽn.{Stay away from me, Jezebel.近づくな またゅる}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:14.43,1:03:17.00,Default,,0,0,0,1,Nặng lời thật đấy.{Now that's an extreme label.うわ一 過激なネ一ミングセンス~}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:18.59,1:03:22.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Chẳng phải tớ đã nói là không có gì xảy ra rồi mà.{Didn't 1 already tell you that nothing happened?}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:22.84,1:03:24.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Sao mà tin được lời cậu nói chứ.{You can't expect me to believe that!}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:25.08,1:03:29.68,Default,,0,0,0,1,Một tên vô lại đi cùng với một đứa con gái trơ trẽn chẳng phải sẽ quan hệ bất...{A scoundrel plus a Jezebel\Nequals an illicit sexual rela--}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:29.51,1:03:32.68,Top dialog,,0,0,0,,Chính tớ cũng ngạc nhiên lắm chứ.{Look, I was surprised myself, too.}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:32.76,1:03:34.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Anh ta hoàn toàn nghiêm túc.{He was always totally serious.}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:34.97,1:03:36.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Đúng là nhát gan.{What a wuss.}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:38.39,1:03:42.90,Default,,0,0,0,1,Vị hoàng tử sẽ giải cứu mình khỏi những chuyện này đang ở đâu nhỉ?{Where's the prince\Nwho'll take me away from all this?}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:42.98,1:03:44.56,Top dialog,,0,0,0,,Ohtaki.{Ohtaki, where's the sign-in sheet\N1 asked you to take care of?}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:44.56,1:03:46.71,Top dialog,,0,0,0,,Tờ danh sách anh đưa em đâu rồi?{Ohtaki, where's the sign-in sheet\N1 asked you to take care of?}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:46.71,1:03:47.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Em xin lỗi!{Sorry! I left it on top of the cart\Nby the entrance!}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:47.86,1:03:50.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Em để nó ở trên xe đẩy ở lối ra vào ạ.{Sorry! I left it on top of the cart\Nby the entrance!}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:48.59,1:04:50.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Sao lại dừng lại?{Why did you stop?}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:53.80,1:04:54.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Tiếp tục đi.{Keep playing.}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:04.42,1:05:05.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Tớ cứ nghĩ...{I had a feeling that when 1 moved to Tokyo,\Nall my dreams would come true.}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:05.77,1:05:08.00,Default,,0,0,0,,nếu mình lên Tokyo...{I had a feeling that when 1 moved to Tokyo,\Nall my dreams would come true.}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:08.00,1:05:10.87,Default,,0,0,0,,những giấc mơ của mình sẽ thành hiện thực.{I had a feeling that when 1 moved to Tokyo,\Nall my dreams would come true.}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:11.44,1:05:13.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Vậy mà không phải vậy?{But they didn't.でも 違うんだな}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:15.30,1:05:17.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Giấc mơ thành hiện thực rồi mà. {But your dream came true.夢 叶えたじやない}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:18.00,1:05:19.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Cậu kiếm sống bằng guitar.{You play guitar for a living.}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:19.57,1:05:24.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Tớ đâu có muốn chơi trong một ban nhạc dự bị cho một ca sĩ enka.{It's not like I wanted to be\Nin the backup band for an enka singer.}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:24.70,1:05:25.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Nhưng...{Still...}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:25.20,1:05:27.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Không phải là tớ phàn nàn gì.{I'm not complaining.}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:28.00,1:05:30.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Tớ biết ơn thầy Nitobe.{I'm grateful to Mr. Nitobe.}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:30.34,1:05:33.38,Default,,0,0,0,,{I'm satisfied to at least\Nbe involved with music.}Tớ hài lòng vì ít nhất mình vẫn được chơi nhạc,
Dialogue: 0,1:05:34.59,1:05:36.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Chỉ là...{But I don't know if it was necessary\Nto leave, considering all the things I gave up.}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:36.17,1:05:38.55,Default,,0,0,0,,sau tất cả những gì mà tớ đã bỏ lỡ,{But I don't know if it was necessary\Nto leave, considering all the things I gave up.}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:38.55,1:05:41.06,Default,,0,0,0,,tớ không biết là có nên rời đi không nữa.{But I don't know if it was necessary\Nto leave, considering all the things I gave up.}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:46.35,1:05:47.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Vậy...{Then, can 1 request a different song?}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:47.55,1:05:49.80,Default,,0,0,0,,tớ có thể yêu cầu một bài khác không?{Then, can 1 request a different song?}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:54.53,1:05:56.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Bầu trời xanh trong mắt em.{"Her Blue Sky."}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:59.77,1:06:00.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Làm sao cậu...{Why do you...}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:01.20,1:06:02.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Tớ đã mua nó.{I bought it.}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:02.54,1:06:04.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Bài hát ra mắt của cậu.{Your solo debut song.}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:04.87,1:06:06.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Thời kì đó đen tối lắm.{But that's my dark past.黒歴史だろ}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:08.88,1:06:12.09,Default,,0,0,0,1,Tớ thích nội dung của nó ngang với bài Gandhara đấy.{I like that song about\Nas much as I like "Gandhara."}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:57.09,1:06:59.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Phong cách Nitobe Dankichi.{Dankichi Nitobe style!}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:11.61,1:07:13.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Kiểu gì vậy?{- What is that? Sing normally!\N- Next, math teacher Saito style!}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:13.52,1:07:15.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Hát bình thường đi mà.{- What is that? Sing normally!\N- Next, math teacher Saito style!}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:14.57,1:07:17.01,Top dialog,,0,0,0,,Tiếp theo là thầy dạy toán Saito.{- What is that? Sing normally!\N- Next, math teacher Saito style!}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:17.36,1:07:21.49,Default,,0,0,0,,{There's really no reason behind it}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:25.66,1:07:26.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Chị Akane...
Dialogue: 0,1:07:27.87,1:07:29.08,Default,,0,0,0,,và...{And...}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:32.42,1:07:37.05,Default,,0,0,0,,người có thể làm cho chị Akane cười như vậy...{the person who can make\NAkane laugh like that..}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:38.05,1:07:39.13,Default,,0,0,0,,quả nhiên...{It can only be...}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:43.14,1:07:45.77,Default,,0,0,0,,chỉ có thể là Shinno.{Shinno, after all.}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:50.31,1:07:52.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Xin cảm ơn rất nhiều.{Okay, thank you very much.}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:54.90,1:07:56.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Đau bụng chết mất.{Ugh, my stomach hurts.}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:56.90,1:07:58.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Thật là,{Sheesh, you were supposed to sing normally.}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:58.10,1:07:59.85,Default,,0,0,0,,hát bình thường đi mà.{Sheesh, you were supposed to sing normally.}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:59.85,1:08:00.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Đúng là,{You know, it's still nice being with you like this.}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:00.65,1:08:02.90,Default,,0,0,0,,ở với cậu thế này vẫn thích thật.{You know, it's still nice being with you like this.}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:03.95,1:08:05.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Cảm giác thật thoải mái.{It's like I can relax.落ち着くつつか}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:06.79,1:08:09.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Tớ đang nghĩ đến việc quay trở lại.{I'm thinking about coming back.}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:10.29,1:08:13.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Với công việc hiện tại thì tương lai tớ sẽ không đi đến đâu cả.{It's not like there's a future\Nahead of me with this current job.}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:13.92,1:08:14.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Không được!{No!}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:15.40,1:08:17.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Biết nói sao nhỉ?{How can I put it? It's like everyone else\Ngot a solid job and is settling down.}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:17.30,1:08:20.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Như những người khác thì sẽ kiếm một công việc,{How can I put it? It's like everyone else\Ngot a solid job and is settling down.}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:20.30,1:08:22.27,Default,,0,0,0,,rồi ổn định mọi thứ.{How can I put it? It's like everyone else\Ngot a solid job and is settling down.}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:22.39,1:08:25.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Có lẽ ở tuổi này tớ cũng nên vậy mới phải.{Maybe I'm at the age\Nwhere I should be doing the same thing.}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:25.32,1:08:26.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Không được!{No! Then "Shinno” will disappear!}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:26.70,1:08:28.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Nếu vậy anh Shinno...{No! Then "Shinno” will disappear!}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:28.41,1:08:29.67,Default,,0,0,0,,sẽ tan biến mất.{No! Then "Shinno” will disappear!それじゃ レんの が いなくなっちゃう}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:29.70,1:08:31.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Cậu đang nói gì thế?{What are you talking about?}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:31.97,1:08:35.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Ở thời đại này, 30 tuổi vẫn còn trẻ lắm.{In this day and age,\N30 or so is still a youngster, right?}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:36.20,1:08:38.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Vẫn còn quá sớm để nghỉ ngơi.{It's too early to settle down.}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:41.42,1:08:45.02,Default,,0,0,0,1,Có những chuyện tớ chỉ có thể thực hiện được ở nơi này.{For me, there's something\Nthat I can only do here.}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:45.02,1:08:47.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Tớ vẫn chưa từ bỏ đâu.{I haven't given up yet on a lot of other things.}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:49.02,1:08:50.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Từ nay trở về sau.{Yep. It's from here on and out.}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:57.13,1:08:58.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Vậy sao?{I see.}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:58.90,1:08:59.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Đúng vậy.{That's right.}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:01.40,1:09:02.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Cậu nói đúng.{Yeah. You're right.}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:09.12,1:09:10.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Cậu vô lại à?{Are you going back?}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:11.40,1:09:12.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Chắc tớ phải vào thôi.{Yeah. I'd better get going.}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:13.31,1:09:14.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Gặp lại sau nhé.{See you later.}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:07.57,1:10:09.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Thì ra khi khóc...{So that's how Akane cries.}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:09.72,1:10:11.66,Default,,0,0,0,,trông chị ấy sẽ như vậy.{So that's how Akane cries.}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:13.08,1:10:14.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Không biết...{I didn't know.}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:15.54,1:10:17.42,Default,,0,0,0,,lần cuối cùng chị ấy khóc...{The last time she cried...}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:19.63,1:10:21.92,Default,,0,0,0,,là khi nào nhỉ?{How long has it been since I saw her cry?}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:37.50,1:10:38.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Chị Akane, lấy giúp em...{Akane, can you get me the--}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:58.12,1:10:59.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Thật là.{Jeez.}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:05.84,1:11:07.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Sổ hướng dẫn?{"Strategy"?"攻略"って}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:33.62,1:11:34.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Này Aoi!{Hey, Aoi!}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:34.79,1:11:35.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Em có sao...{- Are you okay?\N- Yummy!}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:35.22,1:11:35.62,Top dialog,,0,0,0,,Ngon quá!{- Are you okay?\N- Yummy!}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:35.90,1:11:36.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Thật là.{Come on, Aoi, if you have nothing to do,\Nthen help me a little.}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:36.80,1:11:38.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Này Aoi,{Come on, Aoi, if you have nothing to do,\Nthen help me a little.}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:38.35,1:11:41.35,Default,,0,0,0,,không có việc gì làm thì phụ chị một tay với chứ.{Come on, Aoi, if you have nothing to do,\Nthen help me a little.あおい君\N暇なら君も少しぐ らい手伝わんかね}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:41.62,1:11:42.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Không đâu!{No way!}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:42.54,1:11:44.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Chị Akane làm các món chiên rất ngon,{You're good at making deep-fried food}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:44.77,1:11:46.85,Default,,0,0,0,,nên các nguyên liệu mới vui mừng...{so the ingredients shout with joy\Nwhen a talented person uses them for cooking.}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:46.85,1:11:50.10,Default,,0,0,0,1,khi có một tài năng đã dùng chúng làm món ăn đấy.{so the ingredients shout with joy\Nwhen a talented person uses them for cooking.}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:51.47,1:11:52.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Chắc là vậy rồi.{I suppose.}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:53.39,1:11:56.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Cái gì mà "gánh nặng" chứ.{What was this "burden”\Nthat I was talking about?何が 迷惑かけてない だ}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:57.14,1:11:58.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Mình luôn nghĩ rằng...{I always had the feeling\Nthat Akane could do anything.}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:58.85,1:12:01.60,Default,,0,0,0,,chị Akane có thể làm mọi thứ.{I always had the feeling\Nthat Akane could do anything.}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:01.63,1:12:03.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Thế nhưng...{But she only looked perfect...}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:03.37,1:12:05.23,Default,,0,0,0,,chị ấy...{But she only looked perfect...}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:05.23,1:12:07.74,Default,,0,0,0,,chỉ tỏ ra hoàn hảo...{But she only looked perfect...}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:28.16,1:12:29.55,Default,,0,0,0,,vì mình thôi.{for my sake.}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:37.52,1:12:38.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Chị ấy...{It's because she's been trying so hard...}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:38.89,1:12:41.05,Default,,0,0,0,,đã phải cố gắng rất nhiều. {It's because she's been trying so hard...}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:44.20,1:12:45.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Vậy mà...{and I..}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:49.33,1:12:51.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Mình...{What am I doing?}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:51.70,1:12:53.26,Default,,0,0,0,,đang làm gì thế này?{What am I doing?}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:29.97,1:13:30.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Chuyện gì thế?{Oh. It's just you, Ao.}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:30.94,1:13:32.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Là Aoi à?{Oh. It's just you, Ao.}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:32.24,1:13:33.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Sao không dùng mật khẩu?{What happened to using our password?\NJeez, you scared me.}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:33.97,1:13:35.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Thật là, làm anh giật mình.{What happened to using our password?\NJeez, you scared me.}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:35.18,1:13:36.45,Top dialog,,0,0,0,,Em thích anh Shinno.{I like you, Shinno.}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:45.34,1:13:47.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Nghe em nói vậy anh vui lắm.{Listen... I'm flattered.}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:47.72,1:13:48.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Nhưng mà...{But think about it really hard.}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:48.40,1:13:49.50,Default,,0,0,0,,em thử nghĩ mà xem.{But think about it really hard.}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:49.84,1:13:51.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Anh là linh hồn...{- I'm a living spir--\N- Shut up!}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:50.70,1:13:51.64,Top dialog,,0,0,0,,Anh im lặng đi.{- I'm a living spir--\N- Shut up!}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:55.07,1:13:55.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Bởi vì...{I mean, your voice is so kind.}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:55.80,1:13:57.09,Default,,0,0,0,,giọng nói của anh...{I mean, your voice is so kind.}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:57.09,1:13:58.30,Default,,0,0,0,,nghe rất dễ chịu.{I mean, your voice is so kind.}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:58.69,1:14:00.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Với giọng nói ấy,{Someone with that kind of voice generally says\Ncomforting and compassionate things.}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:00.36,1:14:04.98,Default,,0,0,0,,anh sẽ lại nói ra những lời khiến em cảm thấy được an ủi và đồng cảm mất.{Someone with that kind of voice generally says\Ncomforting and compassionate things.}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:07.48,1:14:09.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Ngay cả khi anh... {Even if you didn't mean to comfort me,}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:09.22,1:14:10.80,Default,,0,0,0,,không có ý định đó đi nữa. {Even if you didn't mean to comfort me,}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:11.53,1:14:13.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Giọng nói ấy vẫn rất dễ chịu,{your voice is wonderful and warm and it kind of\Nmakes me sad, so 1 don't want 10 hear it.}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:13.95,1:14:15.87,Default,,0,0,0,,vẫn rất ấm áp,{your voice is wonderful and warm and it kind of\Nmakes me sad, so 1 don't want 10 hear it.}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:15.87,1:14:17.89,Default,,0,0,0,,vậy chỉ khiến em buồn hơn thôi,{your voice is wonderful and warm and it kind of\Nmakes me sad, so 1 don't want 10 hear it.}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:17.89,1:14:19.25,Default,,0,0,0,,nên em không muốn nghe.{your voice is wonderful and warm and it kind of\Nmakes me sad, so 1 don't want 10 hear it.}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:20.66,1:14:21.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Trước mắt,{For now, let me get all of my feelings out.}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:21.41,1:14:23.50,Default,,0,0,0,,cứ để em nói hết cảm xúc của mình đã.{For now, let me get all of my feelings out.}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:34.87,1:14:36.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Em thích anh Shinno.{I like you, Shinno.}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:38.14,1:14:40.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Không phải Shinnosuke,{Not "Shinnosuke,"\Nbut you, the "Shinno" who's right here.}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:40.21,1:14:41.11,Default,,0,0,0,,mà là...{Not "Shinnosuke,"\Nbut you, the "Shinno" who's right here.}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:41.11,1:14:43.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Shinno đang hiện diện ở đây.{Not "Shinnosuke,"\Nbut you, the "Shinno" who's right here.}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:43.96,1:14:45.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Em muốn được ở bên anh.{I want to be with you forever.}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:46.59,1:14:49.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Thay vì quay trở về với thân xác Shinnosuke,{Rather than have you return to "Shinnosuke,"}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:49.48,1:14:51.19,Default,,0,0,0,,em muốn anh ở lại đây.{I want you to stay here!今のままでいてほしい!}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:53.65,1:14:54.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Ao...
Dialogue: 0,1:14:54.53,1:14:55.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Nhưng mà...{But...}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:56.47,1:14:57.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Nhưng mà...{But...}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:58.93,1:15:00.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Em cũng...{I also love Akane!}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:00.05,1:15:02.03,Default,,0,0,0,,rất yêu quý chị Akane!{I also love Akane!}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:04.20,1:15:05.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Còn chị Akane...{And Akane...}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:06.09,1:15:09.21,Default,,0,0,0,,vẫn còn tình cảm với anh Shinnosuke.{still loves "Shinnosuke."}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:10.00,1:15:12.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Em muốn chị Akane được hạnh phúc.{When I think about Akane's happiness...}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:13.75,1:15:15.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Nhưng mà như thế anh Shinno sẽ...{But then you would...}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:18.22,1:15:20.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Em không biết nên làm thế nào nữa.{I don't know what 1 should do anymore.}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:22.74,1:15:24.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Em phải làm sao đây?{Tell me, what should I do?}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:26.16,1:15:27.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Đừng chạm vào em.{Don't touch me!}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:29.19,1:15:30.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Nếu anh làm vậy,{If you touch me,\Nit'll only make me like you even more!}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:30.73,1:15:32.90,Default,,0,0,0,,thì em càng thích anh hơn mà thôi.{If you touch me,\Nit'll only make me like you even more!}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:33.65,1:15:35.19,Default,,0,0,0,,V-Vậy...{Th-Then... what should 1 do?}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:35.19,1:15:36.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Anh biết phải làm sao?{Th-Then... what should 1 do?}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:36.69,1:15:38.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Anh cũng không biết sao?{You don't know either?}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:38.64,1:15:39.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Làm sao anh biết được?{How could 1 know"?}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:39.91,1:15:41.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Thế...{Then...}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:44.41,1:15:45.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Thôi bỏ đi!{Never mind!}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:46.36,1:15:47.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Đợi đã, Aoi!{Hey, wait! 1 said wait!}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:47.38,1:15:48.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Chờ chút đã.{Hey, wait! 1 said wait!}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:48.66,1:15:49.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Xin em đấy!{Please!}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:51.46,1:15:52.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Xin em đấy!{Please...}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:54.25,1:15:55.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Chờ chút đã.{Wait...}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:55.96,1:15:57.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Anh...{I... can't run after you.}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:57.11,1:15:58.84,Default,,0,0,0,,không thể chạy theo em được.{I... can't run after you.}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:00.69,1:16:03.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Dù anh có muốn đuổi theo,{Even if I want to run after you, it's impossible.}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:03.44,1:16:04.65,Default,,0,0,0,,cũng không thể được.{Even if I want to run after you, it's impossible.}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:06.67,1:16:08.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Anh chỉ có thể nhìn em rời khỏi đây.{All I can do is see you off from here.}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:10.94,1:16:12.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Anh cũng không biết...{I don't have any idea either, of what\Nwould happen if I return to my original self.}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:12.66,1:16:14.65,Default,,0,0,0,,chuyện gì sẽ xảy ra...{I don't have any idea either, of what\Nwould happen if I return to my original self.}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:14.65,1:16:17.92,Default,,0,0,0,,khi quay trở lại thân xác của mình nữa.{I don't have any idea either, of what\Nwould happen if I return to my original self.}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:18.90,1:16:20.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Nhưng...{But only being able to watch\Nas you run off crying like a brat is...}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:20.75,1:16:22.25,Default,,0,0,0,1,anh không thể...{But only being able to watch\Nas you run off crying like a brat is...}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:22.25,1:16:25.25,Default,,0,0,0,1,chỉ biết đứng nhìn em khóc...{But only being able to watch\Nas you run off crying like a brat is...}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:25.25,1:16:27.50,Default,,0,0,0,1,rồi rời đi như thế được.{But only being able to watch\Nas you run off crying like a brat is...でも こぅやつてガキみたいに泣いてるあおを\N見送るしかできねえのは}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:30.03,1:16:31.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Em không khóc.{I'm not crying.}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:32.75,1:16:34.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Em không khóc.{I'm not crying!}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:34.58,1:16:36.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Do trời mưa thôi.{It's the rain!}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:44.25,1:16:45.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Này,{Hey, why am I here?}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:45.77,1:16:47.89,Default,,0,0,0,,tại sao ta lại ở đây vậy?{Hey, why am I here?}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:52.19,1:16:54.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Tại sao...vậy?{Why?}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:26.30,1:17:27.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Chào buổi sáng.{Morning.}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:29.40,1:17:31.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Chào buổi sáng.{Morning. Um...}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:31.12,1:17:32.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Có chuyện này.{Morning. Um...}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:32.90,1:17:34.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Chuyện hôm qua.{About yesterday... I'm sorry.}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:34.20,1:17:34.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Tớ xin lỗi.{About yesterday... I'm sorry.}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:35.65,1:17:38.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Thôi, thôi, không cần phải xin lỗi đâu.{Oh, there's no need to apologize!}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:38.15,1:17:40.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Dù gì thì tớ cũng đã làm cậu khó chịu mà. {- I was totally bothering you about it, too.\N- But...}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:40.32,1:17:40.90,Top dialog,,0,0,0,,Nhưng...{- I was totally bothering you about it, too.\N- But...}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:40.90,1:17:42.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Cho nên là...{Well, uh--}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:42.05,1:17:43.20,Top dialog,,0,0,0,,Không có!{It's not here!}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:43.62,1:17:45.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Không có!{It's not here!}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:45.42,1:17:47.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Thầy làm mất thứ gì sao ạ?{Are you missing something, Mr. Nitobe?}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:47.32,1:17:48.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Dây chuyền của tôi.{My pendant! The one\NI'm always wearing is gone!}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:48.52,1:17:51.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Sợi dây mà tôi luôn đeo giờ không thấy đâu nữa.{My pendant! The one\NI'm always wearing is gone!}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:51.57,1:17:52.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Dây chuyền?{Pendant? Oh! That gaudy looking one.}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:52.97,1:17:53.87,Default,,0,0,0,,À,{Pendant? Oh! That gaudy looking one.}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:53.87,1:17:55.87,Default,,0,0,0,1,là cái sáng loáng đấy hả?{Pendant? Oh! That gaudy looking one.あの趣味の悪い}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:58.00,1:18:00.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Đó chính là nguồn năng lượng của tôi.{That's the source of my energy.}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:00.75,1:18:05.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Tất cả những cảm xúc từ những con người ở vùng đất này được chứa đựng bên trong đấy. {All the feelings I've received from people\Nall across this land are sealed inside of it.}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:05.89,1:18:06.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Nếu không có nó,{Without it, I won't be able\Nto sing the local heart.}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:06.92,1:18:09.07,Default,,0,0,0,,tôi sẽ không thể hát bằng cả trái tim,{Without it, I won't be able\Nto sing the local heart.}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:09.07,1:18:12.05,Default,,0,0,0,,không thể hát lên tiếng lòng của enka được.{I won't be able to sing the heart of enka!}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:12.98,1:18:15.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Câu này nghe quen thật đấy.{That phrase sounds really familiar to me.}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:17.42,1:18:18.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Thầy ơi,{Mr. Nitobe, it wasn't in the car either.}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:18.45,1:18:20.73,Default,,0,0,0,,trong xe cũng không tìm thấy.{Mr. Nitobe, it wasn't in the car either.}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:22.11,1:18:23.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Thầy.{Mr. Nitobe.}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:23.32,1:18:24.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Thế...{Well, when was the last time you saw it?}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:24.52,1:18:27.32,Default,,0,0,0,,lần cuối thầy nhìn thấy nó là khi nào vậy?{Well, when was the last time you saw it?}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:27.82,1:18:28.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Lần cuối à?{The last time?}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:29.10,1:18:30.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Nếu vậy thì...{In that case, um...}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:30.55,1:18:32.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Xem nào.{In that case, um...}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:32.62,1:18:33.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Tàn tích Wado.{Oh, the Wado Ruins.}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:33.87,1:18:35.08,Default,,0,0,0,,A, đây rồi!{Oh, there it is!}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:35.16,1:18:36.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Đây là...{Could that be Mitsumine Shrine?}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:36.87,1:18:38.45,Default,,0,0,0,,đền Mitsumine!{Could that be Mitsumine Shrine?}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:38.45,1:18:40.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Đi chơi nhiều thật.{You're having too much fun.満喫しすぎ }
Dialogue: 0,1:18:40.27,1:18:41.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Vả lại...{I mean, in every photo, you have\Nyour arms around women's shoulders.}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:41.37,1:18:44.42,Default,,0,0,0,,bức ảnh nào cũng thấy ông ấy khoác vai phụ nữ.{I mean, in every photo, you have\Nyour arms around women's shoulders.}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:45.30,1:18:48.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Nó thể hiện sự hòa hợp giữa ta và người dân ở đây đấy.{That's the rapport I have with locals.}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:48.22,1:18:50.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Những bức ảnh này là từ hôm qua.{So these pictures are from yesterday.}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:50.76,1:18:51.81,Default,,0,0,0,,A, bức này.{Oh, this one.}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:51.89,1:18:53.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Sợi dây biến mất từ bức này.{From this photo on,\Nyou're not wearing the pendant.}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:54.00,1:18:55.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Đúng rồi.{Oh yeah.}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:55.00,1:18:56.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Như vậy là...{Then...}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:56.64,1:18:58.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Nơi cuối cùng mà ông ấy còn đeo nó là...{The last place he had it on it was...}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:59.31,1:19:00.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Đây rồi!{There!}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:00.23,1:19:01.72,Default,,0,0,0,,A, con đường hầm này.{Yes, this tunnel!}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:01.73,1:19:03.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Rất duyên dáng đúng không?{Charming, isn't it?風情があるでしよう?}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:03.57,1:19:05.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Có một hàng rào ở đấy,{There was a fence,\Nbut I just went through it like this...}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:05.30,1:19:06.82,Default,,0,0,0,1,ta đi qua nó như vầy.{There was a fence,\Nbut I just went through it like this...}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:06.90,1:19:07.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Chính là nó!{That's it!}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:07.95,1:19:12.58,Default,,0,0,0,1,Thảo nào lúc ấy bản năng sinh tồn như mách bảo ta điều gì đấy.{Yes, it did have this sort of\Nsurvival instinct feeling to it.}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:12.66,1:19:14.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Vậy để tôi đến đó lấy cho.{Then I'll go look for it there.}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:15.57,1:19:17.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Có được không?{Huh? Are you sure?}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:17.25,1:19:19.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Thầy cứ việc chuẩn bị cho buổi tập ạ.{In the meantime,\Nplease prepare for rehearsal, Mr. Nitobe.}
