Dialogue: 0,1:33:21.55,1:33:23.90,Default,,0,0,0,1,Em đã nghỉ mình muốn thoát khỏi nơi đây... {I thought I couldn't wait to get out of here,\Nbut it's so beautiful."出たい 出たい"}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:25.28,1:33:27.26,Default,,0,0,0,,nhưng không ngờ nó đẹp đến vậy.{I thought I couldn't wait to get out of here,\Nbut it's so beautiful."出たい 出たい"}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:30.42,1:33:31.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Ừm.{Yeah.}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:34.78,1:33:35.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Đúng vậy.{It is.}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:47.49,1:33:48.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Thấy rồi.{Found it.}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:49.52,1:33:50.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Thật là...{Good grief. All that trouble over this.}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:51.33,1:33:52.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Đúng là món đồ rắc rối.{Good grief. All that trouble over this.お騒がせですね\Nまつたく}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:52.84,1:33:55.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Trong tình huống nguy hiểm thế này vậy mà...{In the middle of this emergency...}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:56.17,1:33:58.34,Default,,0,0,0,,cậu đúng là tinh thần thép đấy.{I swear, you have nerves of steel.}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:03.47,1:34:04.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Shinno?
Dialogue: 0,1:34:14.28,1:34:15.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Tới nơi rồi!{There you are!}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:16.94,1:34:17.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Cậu ta...{Where's the other me?}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:18.03,1:34:18.86,Default,,0,0,0,,đâu rồi?{Where's the other me?}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:19.90,1:34:20.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Akane sao rồi?{Where's Akane?}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:26.03,1:34:27.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Thì ra là vậy.{I see.}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:27.74,1:34:29.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Khó tin thật đấy.{It's preposterous, huh?荒唐無稽だね}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:30.20,1:34:31.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Đúng là Shinno rồi.{It's very you, Shinno.しんの らしいや}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:31.78,1:34:33.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Cậu tin tớ sao?{You believe me?}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:33.20,1:34:34.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Tại vì,{After all, you're here, in front of me.}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:34.09,1:34:36.21,Default,,0,0,0,,cậu đang đứng trước mặt tớ còn gì.{After all, you're here, in front of me.}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:37.49,1:34:40.11,Default,,0,0,0,1,Đúng là không gì làm cậu bối rối được.{It's scary how nothing fazes you.}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:41.01,1:34:42.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Mà cũng may thật.{But I'm glad.}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:43.28,1:34:44.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Trong này còn tối.{It's dark in here.ここ  暗くて}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:45.22,1:34:46.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Nếu ra ngoài sáng,{If it were bright,\Nyou can see how old I've gotten.}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:46.56,1:34:48.12,Default,,0,0,0,,cậu sẽ thấy tớ trông già đi.{If it were bright,\Nyou can see how old I've gotten.}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:48.97,1:34:51.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Shinno sẽ thất vọng mất.{You'd be disappointed, Shinno.}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:51.53,1:34:53.00,Default,,0,0,0,,À, xin lỗi,{Sorry. I've already seen how you look now.}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:53.00,1:34:54.93,Default,,0,0,0,,tớ đã lỡ nhìn thấy cậu mất rồi.{Sorry. I've already seen how you look now.}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:55.71,1:34:56.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Khi nào? Ở đâu?{What? When? Where?}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:56.94,1:34:58.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Ở căn nhà gỗ.{In the hall.}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:59.11,1:35:01.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Khi cậu đến kiểm tra Ao,{When you went to check on Ao\Nand when you brought rice balls.}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:01.21,1:35:02.90,Default,,0,0,0,,và lúc mang cơm nắm đến.{When you went to check on Ao\Nand when you brought rice balls.}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:04.11,1:35:05.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Thật sao?{Really?}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:05.74,1:35:07.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Vẫn là rong biển.{They were kelp again.}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:08.91,1:35:12.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Dù bao lần bảo cậu làm cơm nắm mayonnaise cá hồi,{The rice halls. I kept telling you\N1 wanted mayonnaise and tuna,}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:12.12,1:35:14.25,Default,,0,0,0,,nhưng lần nào cũng là món mà Ao thích.{but you always made them\Nwith Ao's favorite kelp.}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:15.33,1:35:16.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Xin lỗi nhé.{Sorry about that.}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:16.75,1:35:17.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Nhưng cũng vì vậy...{But you know...}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:19.08,1:35:20.42,Default,,0,0,0,,mà giờ tớ đã hiểu.{I understand now.}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:24.13,1:35:27.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Ếch ngồi đáy giếng không biết được sự bao la của biển cả,{"The frog at the bottom of a well\Ndoesn't know the vastness of the sea,"}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:28.13,1:35:30.85,Default,,0,0,0,,nhưng nó thấu hiểu sắc xanh của bầu trời.{"but it does know the blueness of the sky."}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:32.78,1:35:34.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Câu nói yêu thích của cậu.{You liked that expression.}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:35.33,1:35:36.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Shinno?{Shinno?}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:37.31,1:35:40.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Mayonaise cá hồi không thể thắng rong biển được nhỉ?{Mayo and tuna can't beat kelp, huh?}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:40.43,1:35:42.52,Default,,0,0,0,1,Một khi đó là sắc xanh của bầu trời.{Once you know how blue the sky is...空の青さを知っちまったら}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:49.58,1:35:51.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Con bé xinh lắm phải không?{She's gotten cute, hasn't she?}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:56.00,1:35:57.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Không biết nữa.{I don't know about that.}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:57.85,1:35:59.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Đúng là đã to xác hơn,{She's gotten bigger, sure,\Nbut she's surly, tactless, and not very smart.でかくなってたけど}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:59.50,1:36:01.14,Default,,0,0,0,,nhưng cọc cằn,{She's gotten bigger, sure,\Nbut she's surly, tactless, and not very smart.愛想よくなくて}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:01.14,1:36:02.76,Default,,0,0,0,,hậu đậu,{She's gotten bigger, sure,\Nbut she's surly, tactless, and not very smart.不器用で}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:02.76,1:36:04.90,Default,,0,0,0,,rồi còn ngốc nghếch nữa.{She's gotten bigger, sure,\Nbut she's surly, tactless, and not very smart.頭もよくなくて}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:06.13,1:36:07.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Vậy mà...{But she's as straightforward as an arrow.}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:07.22,1:36:08.86,Default,,0,0,0,,lại thẳng tính cực kì.{But she's as straightforward as an arrow.だけど スツグまっすぐで・・・}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:09.01,1:36:10.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Ừm.{Yeah. Straightforward and dumb.}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:10.38,1:36:11.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Rất thẳng tính.{Yeah. Straightforward and dumb.}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:11.76,1:36:13.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Và ngốc nghếch.{Yeah. Straightforward and dumb.}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:14.57,1:36:17.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Rất giống với Shinno.{That's where she reminds me a lot of you.}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:19.02,1:36:20.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Tớ vui lắm.{I'm glad.}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:22.94,1:36:24.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Cô em gái Ao...{Your little sister, Ao,\Nis the most precious thing in the world to you.}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:24.38,1:36:27.05,Default,,0,0,0,,chính là người mà cậu thương yêu nhất.{Your little sister, Ao,\Nis the most precious thing in the world to you.}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:31.11,1:36:33.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Thật vui vì đã...{I'm glad I fell in love with you.}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:33.55,1:36:34.58,Default,,0,0,0,,phải lòng cậu.{I'm glad I fell in love with you.}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:39.38,1:36:41.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Không được!{You can't!}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:41.00,1:36:44.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Lớp đất đá có thể tiếp tục sạt lở bất cứ lúc nào.{It could collapse again at any moment,\Nso unless you can fly...}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:44.41,1:36:46.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Anh lại không biết bay. {It could collapse again at any moment,\Nso unless you can fly...}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:46.21,1:36:47.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Buông anh ra.{Let go of me! Akane is still...}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:47.65,1:36:48.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Akane đang...{Let go of me! Akane is still...}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:50.88,1:36:52.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Hai người đang làm gì vậy?{What are you two doing?}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:56.27,1:36:57.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Akane, thật may...{Akane! Thank g--}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:57.16,1:36:58.02,Top dialog,,0,0,0,,Aoi!
Dialogue: 0,1:36:59.21,1:37:00.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Chị Akane...{Whoa! Akane, you're heavy.}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:00.21,1:37:00.94,Default,,0,0,0,,nặng quá.{Whoa! Akane, you're heavy.}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:01.36,1:37:02.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Xấu tính thế.{What, that's mean.}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:02.29,1:37:03.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Mà chị có sao không thế?{Wait, you're okay?}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:04.19,1:37:05.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Không có chuyện gì đâu!{It was nothing! You're such a worrywart.}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:05.71,1:37:07.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Em lo lắng quá rồi!{It was nothing! You're such a worrywart.}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:07.18,1:37:08.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Chị nói gì thế?{What are you talking about?}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:08.82,1:37:10.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Mọi người lo cho chị lắm đấy!{We were all worried about you!}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:10.90,1:37:12.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Chị xin lỗi nhé, Aoi.{I'm sorry, Aoi. Sorry to make you worry!}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:12.85,1:37:14.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Đã làm em phải lo lắng.{I'm sorry, Aoi. Sorry to make you worry!}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:16.91,1:37:18.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Thật là,{Jeez! You should be sorry!}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:18.32,1:37:20.46,Default,,0,0,0,,chị nói đúng rồi đấy!{Jeez! You should be sorry!}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:42.60,1:37:43.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Hả?{Huh? You're going home by yourself?}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:43.72,1:37:45.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Em sẽ tự về à?{Huh? You're going home by yourself?}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:46.72,1:37:47.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Tại sao vậy?{Why? We can all fit in here.}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:47.70,1:37:49.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Vẫn còn đủ chỗ mà.{Why? We can all fit in here.}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:49.11,1:37:50.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Không đâu.{No, four people is a tight squeeze\Nin your car, Akane.}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:50.29,1:37:52.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Bốn người chui vào xe chị thì chật lắm.{No, four people is a tight squeeze\Nin your car, Akane.}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:53.10,1:37:55.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Em sẽ bắt taxi trên đường về.{I'll catch a taxi on the way back.}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:55.24,1:37:55.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Vậy...{- In that case, I'll...\N- Nah.}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:55.74,1:37:57.49,Default,,0,0,0,,thì để anh...{- In that case, I'll...\N- Nah.}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:57.87,1:37:59.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Ba người đi trước đi.{You three go.}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:00.28,1:38:01.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Aoi?
Dialogue: 0,1:38:03.60,1:38:04.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Tạm biệt...{See you, Shinno.}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:04.61,1:38:05.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Shinno.{See you, Shinno.}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:08.84,1:38:09.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Cảm ơn em nhé.{Thanks...}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:10.21,1:38:11.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Mắt sao.{eyeball star.}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:29.32,1:38:30.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Cậu ta...{Is he...}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:31.13,1:38:32.28,Default,,0,0,0,,ngủ rồi à?{sleeping?}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:34.04,1:38:35.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Không sao.{It's fine, isn't it? He worked hard.}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:35.26,1:38:36.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Cậu ấy đã rất cố gắng rồi!{It's fine, isn't it? He worked hard.}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:42.66,1:38:43.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Tớ...{Hey, 1...}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:45.62,1:38:46.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Cậu ta..{He said 1 moved forward.}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:46.70,1:38:48.96,Default,,0,0,0,,bảo rằng tớ đã tiến lên phía trước.{He said I moved forward.}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:51.13,1:38:52.24,Default,,0,0,0,,nhưng...{But I'm still only midway through all of it.}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:52.24,1:38:53.97,Default,,0,0,0,,mới được nửa đường thôi.{But I'm still only midway through all of it. けど まだ全部途中なんだ}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:55.93,1:38:57.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Nhờ câu nói ấy...{I remembered that I'm only midway through.}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:57.45,1:38:58.47,Default,,0,0,0,,mà tớ đã tỉnh ngộ. {I remembered that I'm only midway through.}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:00.25,1:39:01.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Vậy nên...{So I don't want to give up either.}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:01.61,1:39:04.19,Default,,0,0,0,,tớ không muốn bỏ cuộc nữa.{So I don't want to give up either.}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:08.98,1:39:10.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Cả cậu nữa...{And I'm not giving up on you either.}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:10.84,1:39:12.52,Default,,0,0,0,,tớ cũng không bỏ cuộc đâu.{And I'm not giving up on you either.}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:23.29,1:39:24.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Ba người chúng ta.{The three of us, huh?}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:27.70,1:39:29.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Ra vậy.{I see. Aoi is about\Nthe same age I was back then.}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:29.20,1:39:30.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Aoi...{I see. Aoi is about\Nthe same age I was back then.}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:30.26,1:39:34.14,Default,,0,0,0,1,giờ cũng trạc tuổi tớ ngày đó rồi nhỉ.{I see. Aoi is about\Nthe same age I was back then.もう あの頃の 私と同じくらいだったんだ}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:44.47,1:39:45.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Lần tới,{Next time maybe I'll try making rice balls\Nwith mayo and tuna inside.}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:45.61,1:39:49.02,Default,,0,0,0,,có lẽ tớ sẽ thử làm cơm nắm mayonaise cá hồi xem sao.{Next time maybe I'll try making rice balls\Nwith mayo and tuna inside.}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:52.33,1:39:53.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Vậy có nghĩa là...{Hey, what does that...}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:24.43,1:40:25.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Không được...{I'm not crying!}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:25.93,1:40:27.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Khóc!{I'm not crying!}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:53.00,1:40:54.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Không được...{I'm not...}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:57.09,1:40:58.26,Default,,0,0,0,,khóc!{crying...}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:04.73,1:41:06.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Shinno ngốc.{Stupid Shinno.}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:32.30,1:41:33.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Bầu trời xanh...{The sky...空}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:35.46,1:41:36.79,Default,,0,0,0,,đáng ghét.{is stupidly blue くつそ青い}
